asr-000397
00:41:59.340 --> 00:42:05.840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Our deliberations must therefore examine both the adequacy of funding and the Department's capacity to deliver.

asr-000398
00:42:05.840 --> 00:42:12.180
