asr-000746
01:04:19.340 --> 01:04:25.220
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And if you look at the population growth in Central Luzon, Metro Manila, and Calabar Zone,

asr-000747
01:04:25.220 --> 01:04:29.200
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I mean, everyone's here, new schools are definitely needed.

asr-000748
01:04:29.760 --> 01:04:34.540
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: My last point is really to address the threat, and I do know everyone's doing this.

