asr-000754
01:04:59.160 --> 01:05:01.500
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Dinoblay na naman yung budget, ganun pa rin yung lines.

asr-000755
01:05:02.500 --> 01:05:09.120
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So when she started delivering the maintenance medicine, high blood,

