01:05:24.020 --> 01:05:25.020
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: hindi lang nabawasan.

asr-000760
01:05:25.220 --> 01:05:28.080
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Hindi lang nabawasan yung lines sa health center.

asr-000761
01:05:28.840 --> 01:05:33.980
