asr-000764
01:05:42.400 --> 01:05:45.440
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So I do know it's a good suggestion, but where do you get the money?

asr-000765
01:05:46.140 --> 01:05:50.620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But just like APECO, which was a, I'll end with that.

asr-000766
01:05:50.620 --> 01:05:54.100
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: There are sometimes one thing that changes everything.

