Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Di ba?

asr-000768
01:05:55.220 --> 01:05:59.820
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Aurora is beautiful, but when APECO came, it changed the economics.

asr-000769
01:05:59.980 --> 01:06:00.120
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Di ba?

asr-000770
01:06:00.780 --> 01:06:04.860
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Tagig, binabaha, et cetera, it was really prayer, dedication to God.

asr-000771
01:06:04.920 --> 01:06:09.340
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: When BGC came, nag-iba.

asr-000772
01:06:09.600 --> 01:06:09.800
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Di ba?

asr-000773
01:06:10.120 --> 01:06:14.740
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: When call centers came to the Philippines, suddenly hindi lang OFWs.

asr-000774
01:06:14.740 --> 01:06:21.960
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So there has to be this one thing that can be done in 2027.

asr-000775
