asr-000777
01:06:28.760 --> 01:06:34.660
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: When he was a new senator, binitbit niya ako sa dinner ata yun with the British Embassy.

asr-000778
01:06:35.260 --> 01:06:38.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Because nga of the, yung mag-amang Senator Angara,

asr-000779
01:06:38.300 --> 01:06:42.940
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: have a lot of background and projects and work with the United Kingdom.

asr-000780
01:06:43.680 --> 01:06:46.660
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And there was a military expert there, if you remember.

asr-000781
01:06:47.280 --> 01:06:48.540
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And he was telling us, di ba?

asr-000782
01:06:49.200 --> 01:06:54.260
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: When they were saying that may decline na yung empire of the United Kingdom,

asr-000783
01:06:54.880 --> 01:06:58.120
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: and they had to scale down the military,

asr-000784
01:06:58.740 --> 01:07:02.560
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: the first thinking was really, how do you not do it?

asr-000785
01:07:02.700 --> 01:07:02.800
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Di ba?

asr-000786
01:07:02.860 --> 01:07:06.520
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: How do you maintain your bases in Singapore and the other colonies?

asr-000787
01:07:06.980 --> 01:07:08.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: How do you have more money?

asr-000788
01:07:08.180 --> 01:07:09.100
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: How do you have your economy?

asr-000789
01:07:09.780 --> 01:07:13.200
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But as time and technology changed,

asr-000790
01:07:13.340 --> 01:07:17.100
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: they said, no, it's not about bigger, it's also about smarter.

asr-000791
01:07:17.800 --> 01:07:17.940
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Di ba?

asr-000792
01:07:18.040 --> 01:07:19.160
