Presentation video: Mas maganda kasi po yung new curriculum.

asr-000912
01:12:28.620 --> 01:12:30.620
Presentation video: Lalo natin naman po pag itating namin sa graduate school,

asr-000913
01:12:30.620 --> 01:12:32.620
Presentation video: may tinatawag na doorway option.

asr-000914
01:12:32.620 --> 01:12:36.620
Presentation video: Na pwede kaming kumuha ng isang elective subject kung gusto namin po.

asr-000915
01:12:36.620 --> 01:12:39.620
Presentation video: Maganda siya para sa akin kasi nakakatulong po ako sa pamilya ko

asr-000916
01:12:39.620 --> 01:12:41.620
Presentation video: and I'm currently now a makeup artist po.

asr-000917
01:12:41.620 --> 01:12:45.620
Presentation video: Pero walang batang umaabot doon ng mag-isa.

asr-000918
01:12:45.620 --> 01:12:49.620
Presentation video: Kailangan niya ng gurong may sapat na oras at suporta.

asr-000919
01:12:50.620 --> 01:12:53.620
Presentation video: Kasi full load, daming gawain.

asr-000920
01:12:53.620 --> 01:12:56.620
Presentation video: Misal na pero kailangan ko pa rin tapusin.

asr-000921
01:12:56.620 --> 01:12:58.620
Presentation video: Pero ngayon naging mas magaan,

asr-000922
01:12:58.620 --> 01:13:02.620
Presentation video: mas nakapokus na ako sa aking tungkulin bilang guro sa mga bata.

asr-000923
01:13:02.620 --> 01:13:06.620
Presentation video: Sa wakas po, mapapagaan po nito ang aming trabaho

asr-000924
01:13:06.620 --> 01:13:10.620
Presentation video: at makakapag-focus po kami sa pagtuturo po namin.

asr-000925
01:13:12.620 --> 01:13:14.620
Presentation video: Siyempre, nandyan yung number one band paper.

asr-000926
01:13:14.620 --> 01:13:16.620
Presentation video: Ink for printer namin.

asr-000927
01:13:16.620 --> 01:13:18.620
Presentation video: Kahit pa isa-isang bilihan o.

asr-000928
01:13:18.620 --> 01:13:22.620
Presentation video: Pag binilang mo at pinagsama-sama, marami din siya at malaki talaga.

asr-000929
01:13:22.620 --> 01:13:25.620
Presentation video: We are grateful na nanagdagan yung teaching allowance namin

asr-000930
01:13:25.620 --> 01:13:28.620
Presentation video: kasi malaking tulong para sa gayon

asr-000931
01:13:28.620 --> 01:13:32.620
Presentation video: mas maturuan at maibigay namin yung pangangailangan ng mga bata.

asr-000932
01:13:32.620 --> 01:13:36.620
Presentation video: At hindi lang trabaho ang kailangang gumaan.

asr-000933
01:13:36.620 --> 01:13:40.620
Presentation video: Kailangan ding magaroon ng pagkakataong umunlad ang guro.

asr-000934
01:13:40.620 --> 01:13:44.620
Presentation video: Ngayon ay nakikita na rin namin ang aming landas

asr-000935
01:13:44.620 --> 01:13:46.620
Presentation video: para sa aming growth or pagunlad.

asr-000936
01:13:46.620 --> 01:13:49.620
Presentation video: Along-along na sa aming paghanda.

asr-000937
01:13:49.620 --> 01:13:53.620
Presentation video: There are times na nakakalimutan rin namin yung sarili naming well-being,

asr-000938
01:13:53.620 --> 01:13:54.620
Presentation video: sarili naming health.

asr-000939
01:13:54.620 --> 01:13:56.620
Presentation video: With this medical allowance,

asr-000940
01:13:56.620 --> 01:14:03.620
Presentation video: nagkaroon kami ng pakiramdam na the government is also looking at our physical well-being.

asr-000941
01:14:03.620 --> 01:14:09.620
Presentation video: At sa paralan, ang pag-aalaga ay hindi nagtatapos sa pagtuturo.

asr-000942
01:14:09.620 --> 01:14:15.620
Presentation video: Sa hirap talaga ng buhay ngayon, talagang masasabi ko napakalaking tulong

asr-000943
01:14:15.620 --> 01:14:18.620
Presentation video: para sa ating mga magulang ng feeding program na iyon.

asr-000944
01:14:18.620 --> 01:14:23.620
Presentation video: Minsan, may mga bagay na hindi mo kayang sabihin sa parents and friends mo

asr-000945
01:14:23.620 --> 01:14:29.620
Presentation video: at nakakagaan po ng loob kapag may taong nakikinig at may concerns sa iyo.

asr-000946
01:14:29.620 --> 01:14:37.620
Presentation video: Bilang magulang, kampante kami dahil hindi lang natututukan ang kanilang pag-aaral,

asr-000947
01:14:37.620 --> 01:14:39.620
Presentation video: kundi ang kanilang kaligtasan.

asr-000948
01:14:39.620 --> 01:14:43.620
Presentation video: Kahit may sakuna, kami ng mga guro at mga bata ay alam na po,

asr-000949
01:14:43.620 --> 01:14:46.620
Presentation video: yung mga paghahanda at dapat gawin.

asr-000950
01:14:46.620 --> 01:14:49.620
Presentation video: Sa katunayan, may mga safety measures na po kami.

asr-000951
01:14:49.620 --> 01:14:56.620
Presentation video: At para magawa ito, dapat maihatid ang mga pangangailangan ng bawat paaralan.

asr-000952
01:14:56.620 --> 01:14:59.620
Presentation video: Ang maganda yung epekto, mabilis at saka maayos.

asr-000953
01:15:00.000 --> 01:15:02.520
Presentation video: yung dating ng mga learning materials sa school.

asr-000954
01:15:03.400 --> 01:15:06.800
Presentation video: Kasi nagiging masaya yung mga estudyante, yung mga teachers.

asr-000955
01:15:09.740 --> 01:15:12.200
Presentation video: Ang daming tumutulong sa ating paaralan,

asr-000956
01:15:12.300 --> 01:15:14.500
Presentation video: yung ating mga stakeholders na laging nandyan

asr-000957
01:15:14.500 --> 01:15:16.740
Presentation video: para tumulong sa mga needs ng school.

asr-000958
01:15:16.900 --> 01:15:21.160
Presentation video: Pero mas napapadali ang pagtulong kapag sentralisado

asr-000959
01:15:21.160 --> 01:15:24.560
Presentation video: at malalaman na mismo kung anong pangangailangan ng paaralan.

asr-000960
01:15:24.960 --> 01:15:27.980
Presentation video: Mas panatagpo kami ngayon dahil ramdam namin

asr-000961
01:15:27.980 --> 01:15:31.300
Presentation video: na ang bawat piso ay nagagamit ng tama

asr-000962
01:15:31.300 --> 01:15:34.600
Presentation video: at napupunta talaga sa edukasyon ng mga bata.

asr-000963
01:15:35.400 --> 01:15:40.120
Presentation video: May mga nasimulan na at mas marami pa tayong gagawin.

asr-000964
01:15:40.760 --> 01:15:45.400
Presentation video: Edukasyon pa rin ang siyang pangunahin nagtataguyod ng kakayahan.

asr-000965
01:15:45.400 --> 01:15:50.400
Presentation video: Kung kaya ito ang nangunguna sa listahan ng administrasyong ito.

asr-000966
01:15:51.300 --> 01:15:54.080
Presentation video: Kaya malinaw ang susunod na hapbang,

asr-000967
01:15:55.180 --> 01:15:56.600
Presentation video: ituloy ang nasimulan

asr-000968
01:15:56.600 --> 01:15:59.660
Presentation video: at palawakin ang naaabot.

asr-000969
01:16:11.120 --> 01:16:14.200
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Thank you. Maraming salamat, Mr. Chairman, Mr. President,

asr-000970
01:16:14.460 --> 01:16:15.700
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Distinguished Senators.

asr-000971
01:16:16.080 --> 01:16:19.440
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: And karamihan ho nung programang na ipakita dun sa video

asr-000972
01:16:19.440 --> 01:16:22.940
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: ay nabigyan support na po ng ating mahal na Senado.

asr-000973
01:16:23.480 --> 01:16:26.300
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: And both the President, Senate President,

asr-000974
01:16:26.600 --> 01:16:30.060
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: and the Vice Chair of the Subcommittee have been chairs of EDCOM

asr-000975
01:16:30.060 --> 01:16:31.800
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: or are chairs of EDCOM.

asr-000976
01:16:32.020 --> 01:16:34.300
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: And we'd like to acknowledge the work of EDCOM.

asr-000977
01:16:34.380 --> 01:16:37.880
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Dr. Yee is there behind you preparing some very difficult questions.

asr-000978
01:16:38.700 --> 01:16:43.920
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: But nonetheless, we'd like to acknowledge the gains made

asr-000979
01:16:43.920 --> 01:16:48.540
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: and not many people know how much reform has been passed

asr-000980
01:16:48.540 --> 01:16:49.780
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: in such a short amount of time.

asr-000981
01:16:49.880 --> 01:16:50.600
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: And we're very thankful.

asr-000982
01:16:51.080 --> 01:16:52.180
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Papasalamat ko kami sa Senate.

