asr-001785
02:03:26.320 --> 02:03:26.940
DepEd Assistant Secretary Roger B. Masapol: Nag-start po yung...

asr-001786
02:03:27.200 --> 02:03:30.280
DepEd Assistant Secretary Roger B. Masapol: Yung feeding po na by August or September.

asr-001787
02:03:30.600 --> 02:03:30.820
DepEd Assistant Secretary Roger B. Masapol: Okay.

asr-001788
02:03:30.940 --> 02:03:31.720
DepEd Assistant Secretary Roger B. Masapol: Nag-start po yung...

asr-001789
02:03:31.720 --> 02:03:34.280
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, tama. It took some time to do the procurement.

asr-001790
02:03:34.720 --> 02:03:37.340
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: It took some time kasi ang laki nga nung talo natin, di ba?

asr-001791
02:03:37.800 --> 02:03:41.620
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Pero as of today, we are successfully implementing this program.

asr-001792
02:03:42.500 --> 02:03:43.180
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: For the record.

asr-001793
02:03:43.340 --> 02:03:43.680
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yes, po.

asr-001794
02:03:44.120 --> 02:03:44.820
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Okay, congratulations.

asr-001795
02:03:45.100 --> 02:03:48.520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Now, kung idadagdag po natin yung grade 2 at grade 3,

asr-001796
