asr-002294
02:26:02.720 --> 02:26:04.040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Usec Oracion, go ahead, please.

asr-002295
02:26:06.320 --> 02:26:09.820
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: Good afternoon, po, Mr. Chair and Sen. Tulfo.

asr-002296
02:26:10.400 --> 02:26:14.300
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: The aral program po is a remediation program.

asr-002297
02:26:14.740 --> 02:26:16.940
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: It comes from the aral law.

asr-002298
02:26:17.880 --> 02:26:22.880
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: We know from international assessments and from national assessments

asr-002299
02:26:22.880 --> 02:26:26.980
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: that we have been doing very poorly over the years.

asr-002300
02:26:27.540 --> 02:26:34.500
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: And so it's very timely that the aral law was passed.

asr-002301
02:26:34.500 --> 02:26:42.760
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: And so now we have a clear basis for a program that will provide remediation

asr-002302
02:26:42.760 --> 02:26:46.580
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: for reading, for mathematics, and for science, po.

asr-002303
02:26:47.440 --> 02:26:50.600
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: Unfortunately, the law is unfunded.

asr-002304
02:26:51.380 --> 02:26:54.440
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: And we have implemented it.

asr-002305
02:26:55.780 --> 02:26:57.180
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: We, last year,

asr-002306
02:26:57.540 --> 02:26:59.600
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: we implemented it for the first time.

asr-002307
02:26:59.780 --> 02:27:01.480
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: We did aral reading, po.

asr-002308
02:27:01.980 --> 02:27:04.500
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: And then we continued on in summer.

asr-002309
02:27:05.240 --> 02:27:11.280
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: And then this school year, po, we're doing reading or literacy and mathematics.

asr-002310
02:27:11.280 --> 02:27:17.160
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: And then we are also already looking into how to do it in science.

asr-002311
02:27:17.860 --> 02:27:21.560
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: The gains have been explained through our video, po.

asr-002312
02:27:21.940 --> 02:27:26.680
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: For example, out of the 6.7 million,

asr-002313
02:27:26.680 --> 02:27:31.060
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: struggling readers on the first year of implementation

asr-002314
02:27:31.060 --> 02:27:32.580
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: by the end of the school year,

asr-002315
02:27:32.740 --> 02:27:35.000
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: that went down to 2.2.

asr-002316
02:27:35.000 --> 02:27:38.160
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: And then the number of learners, naman, po,

asr-002317
02:27:38.560 --> 02:27:42.200
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: who are able to read at grade level increased.

asr-002318
02:27:42.540 --> 02:27:45.460
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: And aside from our own metrics, po,

asr-002319
02:27:45.580 --> 02:27:47.720
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: we engaged the youth impact,

asr-002320
02:27:47.820 --> 02:27:50.080
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: and that was also presented a while ago.

asr-002321
02:27:50.940 --> 02:27:53.080
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: And so that's it, po.

asr-002322
02:27:53.180 --> 02:27:54.500
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: That's its importance.

asr-002323
02:27:55.220 --> 02:27:56.000
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: It's the mainstream.

asr-002324
02:27:56.680 --> 02:27:59.900
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: It's the strategy by which we can improve

asr-002325
02:27:59.900 --> 02:28:02.220
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: the outcomes for our learners,

asr-002326
02:28:02.600 --> 02:28:06.060
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: specifically those who are not performing

asr-002327
02:28:06.060 --> 02:28:09.100
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: at expected levels in the grade level.

asr-002328
02:28:09.100 --> 02:28:10.860
