Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: quality of education, and whether you talk about mental health,

asr-002820
02:45:51.580 --> 02:45:54.420
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: whether you talk about teenage pregnancy,

asr-002821
02:45:54.440 --> 02:45:57.660
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: whether you talk about school shooting,

asr-002822
02:45:58.320 --> 02:46:02.480
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: quality time with their teachers is important.

asr-002823
02:46:03.200 --> 02:46:07.580
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So kung dati tayong 8 hours sa school, ngayon 5.5 hours na lang.

asr-002824
02:46:08.320 --> 02:46:13.220
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kung dati tayong 40 sa isang classroom, it hasn't been 40 in maybe 20 years,

asr-002825
02:46:13.340 --> 02:46:15.260
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: but I'm talking before that, no?

asr-002826
02:46:16.320 --> 02:46:18.340
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ngayon, 50, 60, 70.

asr-002827
02:46:19.060 --> 02:46:21.040
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kung dati may recess at lunch,

asr-002828
02:46:21.040 --> 02:46:24.140
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: so studies show that not only should you have,

asr-002829
02:46:24.440 --> 02:46:26.800
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: 30-minute lunch, it should be a sit-down lunch.

asr-002830
02:46:27.480 --> 02:46:30.380
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So even if we provide the food and it's nutritious,

asr-002831
02:46:30.840 --> 02:46:34.740
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: if they take it with them and they don't sit down for at least 20 minutes,

asr-002832
02:46:36.460 --> 02:46:41.940
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: yung both the nutritional and also the fellowship and the, you know, being with students,

asr-002833
02:46:43.340 --> 02:46:45.480
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: apektado talaga ito, no?

asr-002834
02:46:45.760 --> 02:46:47.040
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So I'll go back to that.

asr-002835
02:46:47.300 --> 02:46:48.160
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Quick question.

asr-002836
02:46:48.160 --> 02:46:53.120
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Some changes when you were still in EDCOM, yung cluster sa kabinete,

asr-002837
02:46:53.600 --> 02:46:54.400
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: between the TESDA,

asr-002838
02:46:54.440 --> 02:46:57.400
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: CHED and DepEd, how's that going?

asr-002839
02:46:58.040 --> 02:47:02.240
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Very good, Your Honor, because the President created an education cluster

asr-002840
02:47:02.240 --> 02:47:06.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: based on the recommendation of EDCOM,

asr-002841
02:47:06.560 --> 02:47:11.120
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: and it's called the Education Workforce Development Group, Your Honor,

asr-002842
02:47:11.480 --> 02:47:14.140
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: headed by Asec Villafuerte.

asr-002843
02:47:16.960 --> 02:47:19.620
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: It comprises eight agencies, actually.

asr-002844
02:47:19.800 --> 02:47:24.140
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: It's an expanded education cluster because it's not only the demand,

asr-002845
02:47:24.440 --> 02:47:28.520
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: the demand side of education, which is the graduates and what careers they will enter,

asr-002846
02:47:28.580 --> 02:47:29.820
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: but also the supply side.

asr-002847
02:47:30.160 --> 02:47:34.220
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: So kasama po namin yung Department of Labor, yung Department of Migrant Workers,

asr-002848
02:47:34.360 --> 02:47:40.340
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: ang DepDev, and some cabinet agencies want to join us, like DOST,

asr-002849
02:47:40.580 --> 02:47:43.080
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: and you mentioned Pisay, Your Honor, and I couldn't agree with you more.

asr-002850
02:47:43.440 --> 02:47:45.360
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: That is definitely the aspiration, Your Honor.

asr-002851
02:47:45.360 --> 02:47:50.320
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: And in fairness, you know, in the time that Senpia and yourself were chairs of the Education Committee,

asr-002852
02:47:50.600 --> 02:47:54.420
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: I've seen so much improvement because yung 34,000 per capita,

asr-002853
02:47:54.440 --> 02:47:58.640
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: dati parang 30,000 lang yun, or 29,000, 27,000.

asr-002854
02:47:58.760 --> 02:48:05.140
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: So kahit papano, it's incremental, but I think all these things have made a difference, Your Honor.

asr-002855
02:48:05.300 --> 02:48:11.720
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: And really, it's a steep climb, but it has become more manageable now because of all the changes.

asr-002856
02:48:11.860 --> 02:48:16.600
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: We're building on what previous generations and previous leaders built upon.

asr-002857
02:48:16.900 --> 02:48:20.540
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: So yung, definitely I've seen the figures increase.

asr-002858
02:48:20.540 --> 02:48:22.740
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Like yung MOOE pa lang, nakita ko natin eh.

asr-002859
02:48:24.440 --> 02:48:26.880
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Yung formula advocated by EDCOM and ADB.

asr-002860
02:48:27.260 --> 02:48:30.320
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: So talagang mas maraming factors were taken into account na talaga.

asr-002861
02:48:30.440 --> 02:48:33.900
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: So it's no longer so one-sided in favor of Pisay.

asr-002862
02:48:34.060 --> 02:48:37.200
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: I think the aspiration is there, although malayo pa.

asr-002863
02:48:38.720 --> 02:48:47.460
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Many of the things that Pisay has, like the computers, the tutorials, the attention to special needs students,

asr-002864
02:48:47.460 --> 02:48:51.600
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: I think we're trying to make our way there, Your Honor.

asr-002865
02:48:52.160 --> 02:48:54.320
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So first, let me say,

asr-002866
02:48:54.440 --> 02:48:55.240
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I agree with you.

asr-002867
02:48:55.760 --> 02:49:00.020
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: There's so much innovation, so much care, so much effort, so much change.

asr-002868
02:49:00.700 --> 02:49:03.120
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: As I said at the start of the hearing,

asr-002869
02:49:03.840 --> 02:49:07.220
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: pasensya ka na kung mas maraming reklamo at anong problema.

asr-002870
02:49:07.700 --> 02:49:10.860
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Just because we're trying to solve it, but that doesn't mean we do not appreciate everything.

asr-002871
02:49:10.860 --> 02:49:11.560
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: We understand, Your Honor.

asr-002872
02:49:11.780 --> 02:49:14.540
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Maybe the main point I wanted to make, that's why I put the Pisay,

asr-002873
02:49:14.540 --> 02:49:20.800
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: because I am only one of the two senators who oppose the K-12.

asr-002874
02:49:21.420 --> 02:49:23.700
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And I showed this chart then.

asr-002875
02:49:24.440 --> 02:49:27.420
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But it was much different, and this was the difference.

asr-002876
02:49:28.080 --> 02:49:37.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Then, at that time, pre-K-12, Pisay already had a semi-K-12 schedule.

asr-002877
02:49:38.600 --> 02:49:43.640
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So ang nadagdag lang sa Pisay, doong first two years noong K-12, was free time.

asr-002878
02:49:44.200 --> 02:49:48.420
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Because they already had what it was without the additional two years.

asr-002879
02:49:49.300 --> 02:49:54.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But when DEPED added another two years, so my point, Mr. Secretary,

asr-002880
02:49:54.440 --> 02:49:58.580
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: if you take out the two years now, I'm not saying that there won't be a problem,

asr-002881
02:49:59.140 --> 02:50:01.560
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: but your per capita and many of your problems,

asr-002882
02:50:01.720 --> 02:50:05.020
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: so let me put it another way, we're looking for a breakthrough.

asr-002883
02:50:05.020 --> 02:50:13.440
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So definitely, just the discussion on the feeding, the internet, yung kuryenta, yung security,

asr-002884
02:50:13.620 --> 02:50:15.900
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: they're making a big, big difference.

asr-002885
02:50:16.220 --> 02:50:18.700
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I'm really talking about more of breakthrough.

asr-002886
02:50:19.240 --> 02:50:24.340
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But the reason I ask about the cluster is kasi yung original,

asr-002887
02:50:24.440 --> 02:50:29.580
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: or MECS or DECS, Ministry of Education, Sports and Culture,

asr-002888
02:50:30.140 --> 02:50:33.180
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: sa cluster ba na yun kasama ang culture at saka sports?

asr-002889
02:50:33.760 --> 02:50:37.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Hindi po namin sila kasama, pero kasama po namin sila sa TEC.

asr-002890
02:50:37.240 --> 02:50:40.700
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Yung NCCA is part of the Teacher Education Council.

asr-002891
02:50:40.900 --> 02:50:44.520
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Since you are one of the most influential voices in education,

asr-002892
02:50:45.300 --> 02:50:46.920
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: and in the cabinet, I hope.

asr-002893
02:50:47.800 --> 02:50:52.780
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I was looking kasi at Director Barnes, and may binulong ako about art.

asr-002894
02:50:54.440 --> 02:50:59.320
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And my staff brought it up to me, and I said, thank you for reminding me.

asr-002895
02:50:59.620 --> 02:51:01.740
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And E.D. Carroll, and don't get mad at him.

asr-002896
02:51:02.380 --> 02:51:09.960
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Because when we started to, I say we because we were either congressmen or senators noon,

asr-002897
02:51:10.360 --> 02:51:15.640
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: when we started to strip down DepEd, we kept on saying, doon na lang muna tayo sa basic.

asr-002898
02:51:16.260 --> 02:51:22.140
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So nag-umpisa doon sa reading and writing muna, kasi nga wala nang baseball field, wala nang football field,

asr-002899
02:51:22.740 --> 02:51:23.740
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: pati yung kung saan nag-a...

asr-002900
02:51:24.440 --> 02:51:32.280
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Monday flag ceremony, yung iba wala nang space, yung dating mga open space na garden,

asr-002901
02:51:32.860 --> 02:51:36.160
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: tinayuan na yung building, yung dating covert court, building na rin ngayon.

asr-002902
02:51:37.080 --> 02:51:41.620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yung iba naman na buildings, meron sa loob na mga additional facilities.

asr-002903
02:51:41.620 --> 02:51:49.360
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And then, after that, ang sinabi, yung PE, strip down na rin natin, and then STEM.

asr-002904
02:51:49.980 --> 02:51:53.720
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ang importante naman sa lahat is science,

asr-002905
02:51:54.440 --> 02:52:00.320
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: technology, math, language, whether Filipino, English.

asr-002906
02:52:01.000 --> 02:52:05.560
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But then, after 20 years, we realized that hindi pwedeng pa na yung academics,

asr-002907
02:52:05.820 --> 02:52:09.120
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: yung parang, kung baga sa atleta, what about the soul?

asr-002908
02:52:09.580 --> 02:52:14.540
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So if you look at private school, whether it's music, whether it's debate club,

asr-002909
02:52:15.020 --> 02:52:20.520
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: whether it's taekwondo, motai, whatever it is,

asr-002910
02:52:20.520 --> 02:52:20.760
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: di ba?

asr-002911
02:52:22.120 --> 02:52:23.200
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Martial arts,

asr-002912
02:52:24.440 --> 02:52:27.380
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: choir, theater,

asr-002913
02:52:28.220 --> 02:52:29.900
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: that's all part of it, eh.

asr-002914
02:52:30.340 --> 02:52:32.380
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So on the other hand, when K-12 came,

asr-002915
02:52:33.000 --> 02:52:35.460
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: the promise was, magkakaroon to ng tracks.

asr-002916
02:52:36.520 --> 02:52:38.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: At the promise was,

asr-002917
02:52:38.220 --> 02:52:41.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: employable ka na, di ba?

asr-002918
02:52:41.520 --> 02:52:43.860
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So TVL, no?

asr-002919
02:52:44.320 --> 02:52:46.520
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So on one hand, binalik natin yung TVL,

asr-002920
02:52:47.220 --> 02:52:50.460
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: but on the other hand, I think if we do a...

asr-002921
02:52:51.700 --> 02:52:53.380
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So let me ask this question now.

asr-002922
02:52:54.440 --> 02:53:00.180
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Did you see the Project Tao of Senator Tessie Oretta Aquino or that was before your time?

asr-002923
02:53:00.180 --> 02:53:01.480
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Sorry, I don't remember.

asr-002924
02:53:01.480 --> 02:53:04.380
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: I remember Senator Tessie, but not Project Tao.

asr-002925
02:53:04.380 --> 02:53:07.580
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So during that time, every time magtatanong sa DepEd,

asr-002926
02:53:07.580 --> 02:53:12.880
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: they had minimal information, but for example, ilan ng teachers, ilan ng school.

asr-002927
02:53:12.880 --> 02:53:16.540
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So she did, kung baga sa politiko na house-to-house,

asr-002928
02:53:16.540 --> 02:53:21.960
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: she did a school-to-school survey and they called it Project Tao during that time.

asr-002929
02:53:21.960 --> 02:53:24.020
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Parang tinao-tao nila yung schools.

asr-002930
02:53:24.440 --> 02:53:29.100
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ngayon, your database, your AI, it's much better,

asr-002931
02:53:29.220 --> 02:53:33.800
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: but if we go down to the district level, would you have that information?

asr-002932
02:53:33.980 --> 02:53:36.420
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Let's say, which school has a clinic, which one hindi?

asr-002933
02:53:36.740 --> 02:53:38.400
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Yes, Your Honor, we have that data now.

asr-002934
02:53:39.320 --> 02:53:42.160
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: That's one of our goals when we came into the department in 2024,

asr-002935
02:53:42.340 --> 02:53:44.260
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: to really substantially improve the database

asr-002936
02:53:44.260 --> 02:53:49.260
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: because much data at the school level is not brought up to the division level.

asr-002937
02:53:49.380 --> 02:53:53.340
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: It's not brought up to the central office level.

asr-002938
02:53:53.340 --> 02:53:54.380
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So may I ask?

asr-002939
02:53:54.440 --> 02:54:02.080
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: May I ask your permission that we start the debate today whether or not we keep K-12 the next five years

asr-002940
02:54:02.080 --> 02:54:04.140
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: or we take out one or two years?

asr-002941
02:54:04.700 --> 02:54:11.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And one way of starting that debate is, can we look at the data, have a checklist?

asr-002942
02:54:11.560 --> 02:54:13.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: A perfect school will have this.

asr-002943
02:54:13.460 --> 02:54:16.500
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: We'll have a clinic, a guidance counselor's office.

asr-002944
02:54:17.160 --> 02:54:22.140
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: We'll have a courtyard or a covered court.

asr-002945
02:54:22.140 --> 02:54:24.140
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: We'll have a community.

asr-002946
02:54:24.440 --> 02:54:25.440
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: We'll have a music room, et cetera.

asr-002947
02:54:26.260 --> 02:54:28.600
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Then we do a score of our schools.

asr-002948
02:54:29.080 --> 02:54:32.620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Bala ka na kung per region, per congressional district and everything.

asr-002949
02:54:32.920 --> 02:54:34.720
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ang point ko lang, Sek, di ba?

asr-002950
02:54:36.860 --> 02:54:40.720
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: If we were, whether a hostile or friendly takeover of a company,

asr-002951
02:54:41.140 --> 02:54:43.420
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: you start with an inventory, di ba?

asr-002952
02:54:43.680 --> 02:54:48.200
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So if we're going to have a debate how to improve the education system,

asr-002953
02:54:48.340 --> 02:54:50.780
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: it's not much of a debate yung pinag-uusapan natin ngayon.

asr-002954
02:54:50.780 --> 02:54:53.840
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: More classrooms, better internet,

asr-002955
02:54:54.440 --> 02:54:55.960
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: feeding, lahat yun.

asr-002956
02:54:56.160 --> 02:54:58.960
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: It's a matter of, Sec Sonny, eto yung pera.

asr-002957
02:54:59.320 --> 02:55:00.620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Where do you put it first, di ba?

asr-002958
02:55:01.020 --> 02:55:04.880
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: The real debate is, do we have the money for K-12?

asr-002959
02:55:06.060 --> 02:55:08.280
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And if not, what do we do?

asr-002960
02:55:09.380 --> 02:55:12.900
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So the reason I asked about the cluster, let me move back to that.

asr-002961
02:55:13.900 --> 02:55:19.460
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Let me lobby that sports and culture and arts be included

asr-002962
02:55:20.460 --> 02:55:24.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: because it's really as much as a part of our education.

asr-002963
02:55:24.440 --> 02:55:30.300
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: As anything else, as math and everything.

asr-002964
02:55:30.440 --> 02:55:35.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: In fact, for example, being a team member.

asr-002965
02:55:36.140 --> 02:55:40.580
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: In school, lalo kung valediktoryang ka, top 10, salutatoryan,

asr-002966
02:55:41.120 --> 02:55:45.360
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: ang tinuturo sa'yo to be competitive, of course, to be honest, to do the hard work.

asr-002967
02:55:45.740 --> 02:55:50.080
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But in sports, tinuturo sa'yo to be, kahit na lahat ng points sa'yo,

asr-002968
02:55:50.080 --> 02:55:53.880
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: kung madupang ka naman at talo naman yung team mo, di ba?

asr-002969
02:55:53.940 --> 02:55:54.200
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Wala.

asr-002970
02:55:54.440 --> 02:55:54.680
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Di ba?

asr-002971
02:55:56.460 --> 02:55:59.560
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Problem solving, arts, di ba?

asr-002972
02:55:59.860 --> 02:56:00.300
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Creativity.

asr-002973
02:56:01.040 --> 02:56:07.540
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So on that one point lang, may you allow me to also lobby kay Director Barnes.

asr-002974
02:56:07.680 --> 02:56:13.040
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I will tell this to the DFA, but I was in Manila Art in SM Aura, no?

asr-002975
02:56:13.060 --> 02:56:15.500
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And it's the first year that they're partnering with the city of Taguig.

asr-002976
02:56:15.500 --> 02:56:20.380
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Although they've been gracious enough to allow us to host them for some time now.

asr-002977
02:56:21.420 --> 02:56:24.180
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Taga DFA yung dating nandun at sinabi niya sa akin,

asr-002978
02:56:24.180 --> 02:56:28.760
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sir, yung dati mong nilagyan ng pondo na soft diplomacy, wala na?

asr-002979
02:56:29.300 --> 02:56:33.400
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Or, I don't know if it's wala na or hindi, but this was the intention nun.

asr-002980
02:56:34.360 --> 02:56:40.420
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: We're always looking for an industry or some kind of breakthrough

asr-002981
02:56:40.420 --> 02:56:43.200
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: where Filipinos can make it big abroad.

asr-002982
02:56:44.280 --> 02:56:44.420
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Di ba?

asr-002983
02:56:44.560 --> 02:56:46.740
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, and it could be like simple like products.

asr-002984
02:56:46.800 --> 02:56:50.880
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: For example, yung ginseng ng Koreano, it's all over the world.

asr-002985
02:56:50.880 --> 02:56:53.100
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, we were hoping at one point in time that,

asr-002986
02:56:53.100 --> 02:56:55.780
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: ah, virgin coconut oil would be our version.

asr-002987
02:56:56.180 --> 02:56:59.480
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Now, we're hoping ube will be our version,

asr-002988
02:56:59.620 --> 02:57:02.280
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: but they might be able to plant that also sa iba, no?

asr-002989
02:57:03.920 --> 02:57:08.540
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: We do supply the world's nurses, engineers sa Middle East, etc.

asr-002990
02:57:08.760 --> 02:57:14.180
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But, sa manufacturing, nauna na tayo,

asr-002991
02:57:14.360 --> 02:57:18.120
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: nakuha na ng China at saka ng Vietnam, di ba?

asr-002992
02:57:18.640 --> 02:57:20.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Electronics, we're still there.

asr-002993
02:57:20.000 --> 02:57:21.100
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: We're struggling.

asr-002994
02:57:21.300 --> 02:57:21.800
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Let's see.

asr-002995
02:57:22.060 --> 02:57:22.680
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Paxilica.

asr-002996
02:57:22.940 --> 02:57:23.080
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: AI.

asr-002997
02:57:23.100 --> 02:57:25.740
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But one thing, it's very obvious.

asr-002998
02:57:27.080 --> 02:57:32.080
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: If you look at the very few artists who made it big in the world,

asr-002999
02:57:33.020 --> 02:57:36.820
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I don't want to name them now kasi I might forget some of them.

asr-003000
02:57:37.200 --> 02:57:41.360
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And, you know, the prices, you couldn't imagine, di ba?

asr-003001
02:57:41.420 --> 02:57:46.980
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: A million dollars for an artwork at yun ay mid-range sa kanya.

asr-003002
02:57:47.140 --> 02:57:48.520
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Hindi pa yun yung upper range, no?

asr-003003
02:57:48.520 --> 02:57:52.940
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: The beauty about art is you don't need to manufacture

asr-003004
02:57:52.940 --> 02:57:53.620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: anything here.

asr-003005
02:57:54.500 --> 02:57:57.820
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: You don't need to import anything from there.

asr-003006
02:57:57.940 --> 02:57:59.320
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: It's the talent ng artist.

asr-003007
02:58:00.200 --> 02:58:04.180
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And, if it's a sculpture, well, yung gagamitin niya for the sculpture.

asr-003008
02:58:04.320 --> 02:58:07.140
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: If it's a painter, then yung canvas and everything, no?

asr-003009
02:58:07.200 --> 02:58:13.320
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, for example, of course, I'd hope we'd be the jewelry center of the world.

asr-003010
02:58:13.880 --> 02:58:15.940
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But even if we're the jewelry center of the world,

asr-003011
02:58:16.340 --> 02:58:18.240
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: let's say we have gold but we don't have diamonds,

asr-003012
02:58:18.240 --> 02:58:20.980
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: you still have to import diamonds.

asr-003013
02:58:21.280 --> 02:58:22.900
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: You still have to have the artisan.

asr-003014
02:58:22.940 --> 02:58:23.740
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: You still have the artisan and everything, no?

asr-003015
02:58:24.200 --> 02:58:30.140
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But for artists, it's really giving them a break abroad, eh.

asr-003016
02:58:30.600 --> 02:58:33.320
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, I hope the National Museum and I don't know who pa,

asr-003017
02:58:33.420 --> 02:58:35.280
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: but the DFA can work together.

asr-003018
02:58:35.780 --> 02:58:38.080
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ang dami natin aspiring artists.

asr-003019
02:58:38.640 --> 02:58:39.360
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Breakthrough lang.

asr-003020
02:58:40.300 --> 02:58:42.240
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And then, really, someone to champion it.

asr-003021
02:58:42.320 --> 02:58:44.640
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kasi, like, Sec Sonny yung sabi sa akin nung isang artist,

asr-003022
02:58:45.140 --> 02:58:49.240
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sir, yung permit namin palabas para sa show abroad,

asr-003023
02:58:49.940 --> 02:58:52.680
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: iba pa daw yun, sabi ng costume, sa permit pa uwi.

asr-003024
02:58:52.940 --> 02:58:56.320
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, these are small things, but it's barriers, eh.

asr-003025
02:58:56.580 --> 02:58:56.760
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Diba?

asr-003026
02:58:57.440 --> 02:58:59.360
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And then, pagka sikat na sikat na,

asr-003027
02:58:59.680 --> 02:59:00.500
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I'll give you an example.

asr-003028
02:59:00.700 --> 02:59:02.640
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Let's say, si Ronald Ventura, diba?

asr-003029
02:59:03.180 --> 02:59:07.040
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Who doesn't want to either know him or appreciate his painting

asr-003030
02:59:07.040 --> 02:59:08.800
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: or have one of his painting

asr-003031
02:59:08.800 --> 02:59:11.020
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: or kung meron siyang show abroad, sama na ako.

asr-003032
02:59:11.540 --> 02:59:13.560
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But what did it take before he got there?

asr-003033
02:59:14.540 --> 02:59:14.680
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Diba?

asr-003034
02:59:14.820 --> 02:59:16.680
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, there's so much we can do.

asr-003035
02:59:16.820 --> 02:59:20.100
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, allow me lang to use half of my five minutes

asr-003036
02:59:20.100 --> 02:59:21.600
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: to just lobby in that.

asr-003037
02:59:21.600 --> 02:59:22.800
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And you,

asr-003038
02:59:22.940 --> 02:59:24.560
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: your father, Senator Angara,

asr-003039
02:59:24.640 --> 02:59:27.420
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: has been a patron not only of the arts,

asr-003040
02:59:27.560 --> 02:59:29.880
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: but diba, of the historical roots and everything

asr-003041
02:59:29.880 --> 02:59:31.840
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: with Spain, Europe, et cetera.

asr-003042
02:59:32.020 --> 02:59:32.820
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, UK.

asr-003043
02:59:33.280 --> 02:59:34.360
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, tapong ko lang sa inyo yun,

asr-003044
02:59:34.420 --> 02:59:35.860
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: but together with the DFA,

asr-003045
02:59:36.560 --> 02:59:38.720
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I think you'll be able to do something good there.

asr-003046
02:59:39.040 --> 02:59:41.040
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: We'll work on it, Mr. Chair.

asr-003047
02:59:41.240 --> 02:59:42.740
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: And EDCOM, actually, in fairness,

asr-003048
02:59:42.860 --> 02:59:46.120
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: has already initiated talks with many famous artists

asr-003049
02:59:46.120 --> 02:59:50.080
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: to spruce up the Deped Arts curriculum.

asr-003050
02:59:50.080 --> 02:59:52.700
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: The likes of Patis Tesoro, Manny Gariba,

asr-003051
02:59:52.940 --> 02:59:53.220
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: et cetera.

asr-003052
02:59:53.760 --> 02:59:59.160
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, I'll link that now with the TVL.

asr-003053
03:00:00.000 --> 03:00:04.240
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And the senior high school tech pro,

asr-003054
03:00:04.780 --> 03:00:08.780
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: one of the promises of K-12 was that employable.

asr-003055
03:00:09.400 --> 03:00:10.540
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: At magkakaroon ng track.

asr-003056
03:00:11.040 --> 03:00:12.620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And then let me link it with TESDA.

asr-003057
03:00:12.700 --> 03:00:15.940
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: That's why I asked about your cluster.

asr-003058
03:00:16.660 --> 03:00:18.560
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: When we passed the K-12,

asr-003059
03:00:19.720 --> 03:00:20.980
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: you were still in the house.

asr-003060
03:00:20.980 --> 03:00:23.920
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And ang sabi nila,

asr-003061
03:00:24.060 --> 03:00:25.980
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: hindi mo na kailangan mag-out-of-school youth.

asr-003062
03:00:27.120 --> 03:00:29.120
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kasi, at malamang,

asr-003063
03:00:29.120 --> 03:00:31.300
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: hindi mo na kailangang mag-college unless gusto mo.

asr-003064
03:00:32.120 --> 03:00:34.560
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kasi pag-graduate mo, employable ka na.

asr-003065
03:00:35.420 --> 03:00:39.460
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But if you look at the last 2013, 2014, 12 years,

asr-003066
03:00:40.900 --> 03:00:42.820
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: palaki ng palaki yung pondo ng TESDA,

asr-003067
03:00:43.220 --> 03:00:44.180
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: which is good.

asr-003068
03:00:44.820 --> 03:00:46.580
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But now they have a three-year course.

asr-003069
03:00:46.580 --> 03:00:50.900
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So instead of graduating senior high school,

asr-003070
03:00:51.600 --> 03:00:53.220
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: na-certified ka na ng TESDA.

asr-003071
03:00:54.200 --> 03:00:57.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Because TESDA is working through the schools

asr-003072
03:00:57.000 --> 03:00:58.580
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: and through the...

asr-003073
03:00:59.120 --> 03:01:00.500
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: tracks.

asr-003074
03:01:01.340 --> 03:01:03.160
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Parang humiwalay completely.

asr-003075
03:01:04.080 --> 03:01:05.640
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And two years ago,

asr-003076
03:01:05.780 --> 03:01:07.500
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I think, Senator Joel, di ba,

asr-003077
03:01:07.640 --> 03:01:08.620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: when you were chairman,

asr-003078
03:01:08.720 --> 03:01:11.160
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: was asking DepEd,

asr-003079
03:01:11.800 --> 03:01:12.540
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: ang sabi nila nga,

asr-003080
03:01:12.620 --> 03:01:14.960
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: minimal yung kanilang with TESDA

asr-003081
03:01:14.960 --> 03:01:17.180
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: at pati yung, what you call this,

asr-003082
03:01:17.180 --> 03:01:18.980
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: yung mag-accredit and trainers.

asr-003083
03:01:19.140 --> 03:01:20.420
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: May trainers pa rin mag-accredit.

asr-003084
03:01:20.980 --> 03:01:23.200
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So now, DepEd has TechPro?

asr-003085
03:01:24.380 --> 03:01:24.600
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Correct?

asr-003086
03:01:25.540 --> 03:01:26.300
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: That's correct, Mr.

asr-003087
03:01:26.620 --> 03:01:28.320
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: It's just a change in nomenclature.

asr-003088
03:01:28.480 --> 03:01:29.040
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: But it's also,

asr-003089
03:01:29.120 --> 03:01:32.260
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: I think the goal is really to change attitudes

asr-003090
03:01:32.260 --> 03:01:34.740
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: towards technical and vocational education.

asr-003091
03:01:35.600 --> 03:01:37.920
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Because there's a cultural bias against it.

asr-003092
03:01:38.260 --> 03:01:39.860
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: And you mentioned employment.

asr-003093
03:01:40.200 --> 03:01:41.320
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: The biggest number of unemployed

asr-003094
03:01:41.320 --> 03:01:42.740
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: are college graduates, actually.

asr-003095
03:01:43.340 --> 03:01:46.560
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: So that's why that should factor into the debate.

asr-003096
03:01:46.780 --> 03:01:48.740
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Of course, it's not just an education question.

asr-003097
03:01:48.840 --> 03:01:51.300
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: It's an economy and industrial policy question.

asr-003098
03:01:51.420 --> 03:01:52.660
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I'm happy you brought that up

asr-003099
03:01:52.660 --> 03:01:55.320
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: because that's, in fact,

asr-003100
03:01:55.320 --> 03:01:58.320
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: an argument to spend more for...

asr-003101
03:01:59.120 --> 03:02:01.760
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: K-12 and to spend more for the trucks.

asr-003102
03:02:01.940 --> 03:02:03.740
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But one-third of our schools

asr-003103
03:02:03.740 --> 03:02:07.080
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: don't have equipment for the trucks.

asr-003104
03:02:07.280 --> 03:02:08.420
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So growing up,

asr-003105
03:02:08.500 --> 03:02:10.600
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: at least kami sa South,

asr-003106
03:02:10.720 --> 03:02:11.940
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: bilib kami sa Don Bosco.

asr-003107
03:02:12.280 --> 03:02:14.080
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kasi whether it's automotive

asr-003108
03:02:14.080 --> 03:02:17.520
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: or panahon namin yung nauso yung mga mobile,

asr-003109
03:02:17.680 --> 03:02:19.920
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: yung mga DJs and everything,

asr-003110
03:02:20.060 --> 03:02:22.220
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: they did assemble their own strobe lights,

asr-003111
03:02:22.340 --> 03:02:25.460
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: their own mirror balls and everything.

asr-003112
03:02:26.400 --> 03:02:29.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So are your trainers in TechPro,

asr-003113
03:02:29.120 --> 03:02:30.540
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: TESDA-certified?

asr-003114
03:02:31.240 --> 03:02:31.880
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-003115
03:02:32.440 --> 03:02:33.100
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Dati hindi.

asr-003116
03:02:33.640 --> 03:02:35.460
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Kaya atsaka dati walang

asr-003117
03:02:35.460 --> 03:02:37.720
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: previous to EDCOM's intervention

asr-003118
03:02:37.720 --> 03:02:39.860
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: na ni Sen. Gatchalian din

asr-003119
03:02:39.860 --> 03:02:41.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: and Sen. Bam.

asr-003120
03:02:41.740 --> 03:02:43.740
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Yung graduates ng DEPED dati,

asr-003121
03:02:43.840 --> 03:02:44.840
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: walang certification.

asr-003122
03:02:45.280 --> 03:02:46.680
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Kasi may gastos yun eh.

asr-003123
03:02:46.720 --> 03:02:49.400
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: May 1,500 kukunin para sa certification.

asr-003124
03:02:49.680 --> 03:02:52.780
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: But I think it was 2023 or 24

asr-003125
03:02:52.780 --> 03:02:54.360
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: that the first year we paid for,

asr-003126
03:02:54.460 --> 03:02:56.340
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: the government paid for the certification

asr-003127
03:02:56.340 --> 03:02:57.620
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: of TVL graduates,

asr-003128
03:02:57.620 --> 03:02:58.620
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: now TechPro graduates.

asr-003129
03:02:59.120 --> 03:03:00.540
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: So they were put on a par

asr-003130
03:03:00.540 --> 03:03:01.840
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: with the TESDA graduates.

asr-003131
03:03:02.200 --> 03:03:03.020
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Dati dehado sila.

asr-003132
03:03:03.420 --> 03:03:04.440
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Hindi alam ng industriya

asr-003133
03:03:04.440 --> 03:03:05.220
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: kung ano yung qualification,

asr-003134
03:03:05.360 --> 03:03:06.020
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: anong tinapos niya,

asr-003135
03:03:06.280 --> 03:03:07.900
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: kahit may high school degree siya.

asr-003136
03:03:08.300 --> 03:03:09.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Walang N-C,

asr-003137
03:03:09.180 --> 03:03:11.240
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: walang national certificate ho siya.

asr-003138
03:03:11.960 --> 03:03:12.200
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So,

asr-003139
03:03:12.700 --> 03:03:14.100
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: ang dami kong tanong dyan,

asr-003140
03:03:14.480 --> 03:03:15.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: but to,

asr-003141
03:03:15.960 --> 03:03:17.700
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I'll work with whoever's in charge na lang,

asr-003142
03:03:17.820 --> 03:03:21.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: but just to close on that issue, no?

asr-003143
03:03:21.520 --> 03:03:23.180
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So how many years do you need

asr-003144
03:03:23.180 --> 03:03:25.400
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: to make sure that all schools,

asr-003145
03:03:25.760 --> 03:03:27.580
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: all junior and senior high school,

asr-003146
03:03:28.320 --> 03:03:29.040
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: actually,

asr-003147
03:03:29.040 --> 03:03:31.040
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: really have the trainers

asr-003148
03:03:31.040 --> 03:03:36.140
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: and equipment for the tracks that they chose?

asr-003149
03:03:36.140 --> 03:03:37.160
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And the second question,

asr-003150
03:03:37.360 --> 03:03:39.100
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: bala ka na which one you want to answer first,

asr-003151
03:03:39.380 --> 03:03:42.880
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: how do they make the choice ngayon?

asr-003152
03:03:43.600 --> 03:03:44.580
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Di ba kasi nung umpisa,

asr-003153
03:03:44.740 --> 03:03:45.860
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: we were more idealistic.

asr-003154
03:03:47.120 --> 03:03:50.480
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: A school can offer four or maraming tracks,

asr-003155
03:03:50.640 --> 03:03:50.840
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: di ba?

asr-003156
03:03:51.260 --> 03:03:52.640
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But I think last year or two years ago,

asr-003157
03:03:52.720 --> 03:03:55.780
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: we streamlined it into tatlo na lang o apat.

asr-003158
03:03:56.520 --> 03:03:58.680
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Then a school can have only one track

asr-003159
03:03:58.680 --> 03:03:59.020
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: rather than two.

asr-003160
03:03:59.040 --> 03:04:00.220
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Then many, right?

asr-003161
03:04:00.740 --> 03:04:02.400
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: It's not as rigid as before, Your Honor,

asr-003162
03:04:02.520 --> 03:04:03.380
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: dati four tracks.

asr-003163
03:04:04.400 --> 03:04:05.140
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: You had the academic,

asr-003164
03:04:05.320 --> 03:04:07.420
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: you had the TVL or the tech voc track,

asr-003165
03:04:07.520 --> 03:04:08.300
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: then you had the sports,

asr-003166
03:04:08.380 --> 03:04:09.100
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: and then you had the arts.

asr-003167
03:04:09.500 --> 03:04:12.160
