03:46:02.820 --> 03:46:03.320
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Okay, good.

asr-004521
03:46:03.400 --> 03:46:05.440
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Because I really feel it's so important to prioritize

asr-004522
03:46:05.440 --> 03:46:09.860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: para alam din ng mga parents na may mahahanap na trabaho

asr-004523
03:46:09.860 --> 03:46:13.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: itong pinasukan na course.

asr-004524
03:46:13.680 --> 03:46:14.640
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So basic.

asr-004525
03:46:14.820 --> 03:46:15.960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Ba't ba lahat nag-nursing?

asr-004526
03:46:16.120 --> 03:46:19.100
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Kasi naniniwala talaga sila na pag nag-nurse sila, may trabaho.

asr-004527
03:46:19.340 --> 03:46:20.620
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Last point ko na lang,

asr-004528
03:46:21.180 --> 03:46:23.100
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: do we already have...

asr-004529
03:46:23.740 --> 03:46:30.800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: pilot schools that are short of PISAI

asr-004530
03:46:30.800 --> 03:46:32.760
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and now all the regions have...

asr-004531
03:46:32.760 --> 03:46:34.340
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I know that's not under you, that's under DOST.

asr-004532
03:46:34.540 --> 03:46:36.000
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But nevertheless, I'm sure you're familiar.

asr-004533
03:46:36.520 --> 03:46:38.260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Of course, let's exclude PISAI.

asr-004534
03:46:38.420 --> 03:46:39.780
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Let's exclude...

asr-004535
03:46:40.600 --> 03:46:45.140
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: It's only PISAI that comes to mind.

asr-004536
03:46:45.280 --> 03:46:46.620
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So other than PISAI.

asr-004537
03:46:47.420 --> 03:46:50.620
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And that one is very science-based.

asr-004538
03:46:50.620 --> 03:46:52.620
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Do we have any...

asr-004539
03:46:53.740 --> 03:46:56.740
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: pilots for classrooms...

asr-004540
03:46:56.740 --> 03:47:00.700
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Not classrooms, schools, na public school

asr-004541
03:47:00.700 --> 03:47:04.180
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: that is now focused on the use of AI

asr-004542
03:47:04.180 --> 03:47:06.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and personalized education?

asr-004543
03:47:06.640 --> 03:47:09.840
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And if not, is this something you would be interested in doing?

asr-004544
03:47:09.960 --> 03:47:11.380
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I mean, it wouldn't cost a lot.

asr-004545
03:47:11.500 --> 03:47:13.900
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I would love to see if you could pinpoint

asr-004546
03:47:13.900 --> 03:47:15.720
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: three random municipalities

asr-004547
03:47:15.720 --> 03:47:17.840
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and then three cities.

asr-004548
03:47:17.840 --> 03:47:22.160
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And maybe the municipality can be beside the city

asr-004549
03:47:22.160 --> 03:47:23.720
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: kasi sa city manggagaling yung magagaling.

asr-004550
03:47:23.740 --> 03:47:24.780
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: na teacher na yun.

asr-004551
03:47:25.420 --> 03:47:30.220
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And these programs can be made available naman.

asr-004552
03:47:30.440 --> 03:47:31.960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: What do you think of that?

asr-004553
03:47:32.240 --> 03:47:33.480
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Wala pa po tayong ganon.

asr-004554
03:47:34.080 --> 03:47:36.500
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: I've heard of those schools in Texas, Your Honor,

asr-004555
03:47:36.600 --> 03:47:39.760
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: where they just do one or two hours of formal curriculum

asr-004556
03:47:39.760 --> 03:47:43.480
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: and the rest are electives and other courses.

asr-004557
03:47:43.760 --> 03:47:45.660
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: So no, we haven't done that quite yet.

asr-004558
03:47:47.140 --> 03:47:49.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But why not during your term?

asr-004559
03:47:49.200 --> 03:47:53.020
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Well, if you allow us or mandate us then...

asr-004560
03:47:53.020 --> 03:47:53.700
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Because it's a departure.

asr-004561
03:47:53.740 --> 03:47:55.840
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: It's a departure from the regular curriculum, Your Honor.

asr-004562
03:47:55.840 --> 03:47:56.900
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But what do you need to do that?

asr-004563
03:47:56.980 --> 03:47:57.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Do you need another law?

asr-004564
03:47:57.860 --> 03:47:58.740
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Do you need a law pa ba?

asr-004565
03:48:00.440 --> 03:48:01.000
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Would you?

asr-004566
03:48:01.680 --> 03:48:02.780
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Would we need a law for that?

asr-004567
03:48:04.060 --> 03:48:05.060
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Sana hindi naman.

asr-004568
03:48:06.240 --> 03:48:06.980
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: O pilot nyo lang.

asr-004569
03:48:07.060 --> 03:48:07.960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Pumayag na kaming lahat.

asr-004570
03:48:07.980 --> 03:48:09.580
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Kung pilot lang ho, pwede ho siguro.

asr-004571
03:48:09.760 --> 03:48:12.080
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: If you're giving us authorization, then we will do.

asr-004572
03:48:12.080 --> 03:48:13.320
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I mean, I'm not dictating.

asr-004573
03:48:13.460 --> 03:48:15.920
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: If you agree that it might...

asr-004574
03:48:15.920 --> 03:48:17.860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: For sure, it's not a bad idea.

asr-004575
03:48:18.420 --> 03:48:22.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So I think it might be worth seeing what we can do

asr-004576
03:48:22.400 --> 03:48:22.860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: with our...

asr-004577
03:48:23.740 --> 03:48:26.140
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Current setup and...

asr-004578
03:48:26.140 --> 03:48:28.700
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: I think we could work with our partners now

asr-004579
03:48:28.700 --> 03:48:30.800
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: and we have e-cared and we have Khan Academy.

asr-004580
03:48:30.980 --> 03:48:32.360
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: So really, we could do a lot of...

asr-004581
03:48:32.360 --> 03:48:34.680
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: There's a lot of room for experimentation, Your Honor.

asr-004582
03:48:35.400 --> 03:48:37.880
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: So I think with your imprimatur, then...

asr-004583
03:48:37.880 --> 03:48:38.520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: If I may, Secretary.

asr-004584
03:48:38.800 --> 03:48:39.560
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-004585
03:48:40.120 --> 03:48:42.520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: ED Carol actually said if we're interested,

asr-004586
03:48:42.680 --> 03:48:46.180
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: we can have maybe not a school but maybe a class

asr-004587
03:48:46.180 --> 03:48:50.020
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: and EDCOM can take the lead in the pilot as well

asr-004588
03:48:50.020 --> 03:48:51.660
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: if you're interested, Senator Pia.

asr-004589
03:48:51.660 --> 03:48:56.300
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: I'd be happy to work with EDCOM and the committee,

asr-004590
03:48:56.720 --> 03:48:58.840
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Your Honor, Mr. Chair.

asr-004591
03:48:59.020 --> 03:49:02.100
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And I mean, if all the AI experts are telling us

asr-004592
03:49:02.100 --> 03:49:02.980
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: this is the way to go,

asr-004593
03:49:03.080 --> 03:49:06.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: then we might as well learn with a few pilot programs

asr-004594
03:49:07.300 --> 03:49:10.420
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and see how does this work in the Philippine setting

asr-004595
03:49:10.420 --> 03:49:15.540
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: with more poverty and our different cultural setup.

asr-004596
03:49:15.700 --> 03:49:16.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Because, yeah, you're right.

asr-004597
03:49:16.520 --> 03:49:18.060
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I mean, the models I've seen are in US

asr-004598
03:49:18.060 --> 03:49:20.320
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: and then I think I might have seen a few in...

asr-004599
03:49:20.320 --> 03:49:21.640
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: With your permission, Mr. Chair,

asr-004600
03:49:21.660 --> 03:49:23.640
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Madam Senator, Your Honor.

asr-004601
03:49:24.200 --> 03:49:26.500
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: In, I think in El Salvador,

asr-004602
03:49:26.680 --> 03:49:28.660
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: they used AI to...

asr-004603
03:49:29.540 --> 03:49:31.440
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: And they married it to the PISA for schools,

asr-004604
03:49:31.680 --> 03:49:34.040
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: which is a program of the OECD

asr-004605
03:49:34.040 --> 03:49:37.920
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: to help schools transform their educational systems.

asr-004606
03:49:38.440 --> 03:49:41.380
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: And certain schools, not quite a large sample,

asr-004607
03:49:41.540 --> 03:49:44.100
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: but certain pilot schools were able to get

asr-004608
03:49:44.100 --> 03:49:46.980
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: the same level scores as Germany

asr-004609
03:49:46.980 --> 03:49:48.900
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: and a lot of the developed countries

asr-004610
03:49:48.900 --> 03:49:50.900
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: because the AI really performed

asr-004611
03:49:51.660 --> 03:49:52.380
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: their role, Your Honor.

asr-004612
03:49:53.100 --> 03:49:55.100
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: My last point, because I love athletes,

asr-004613
03:49:55.220 --> 03:49:56.380
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: but before I go to the last point,

asr-004614
03:49:56.480 --> 03:49:59.360
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: because the chairman stood up for a few minutes.

asr-004615
03:50:00.720 --> 03:50:01.640
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Mr. Chairman.

asr-004616
03:50:03.520 --> 03:50:04.640
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: No worries.

asr-004617
03:50:04.780 --> 03:50:06.140
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I just wanted you to be here

asr-004618
03:50:06.140 --> 03:50:11.060
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: when I just indicate the additional food budget

asr-004619
03:50:11.060 --> 03:50:13.580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: needed for the student athletes

asr-004620
03:50:13.580 --> 03:50:15.280
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: in the National Academy for Sports

asr-004621
03:50:15.280 --> 03:50:18.900
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: because they only receive 250 pesos per day.

asr-004622
03:50:19.200 --> 03:50:20.900
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And if it can be aligned,

asr-004623
03:50:21.660 --> 03:50:23.880
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: with the closer to the budget

asr-004624
03:50:23.880 --> 03:50:25.240
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: of Philippine Sports Commission,

asr-004625
03:50:25.360 --> 03:50:26.780
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: 1,200 a day,

asr-004626
03:50:27.440 --> 03:50:29.800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: 900 per day lang yung hinihingi.

asr-004627
03:50:30.040 --> 03:50:33.260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And so this is 69 million.

asr-004628
03:50:33.480 --> 03:50:34.540
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So just putting it there.

asr-004629
03:50:34.940 --> 03:50:36.900
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Because again, we all know,

asr-004630
03:50:37.000 --> 03:50:38.700
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: we take such pride.

asr-004631
03:50:39.000 --> 03:50:40.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Like it used to be Manny Pacquiao,

asr-004632
03:50:40.780 --> 03:50:42.900
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: everybody tunes in, walang nakawan,

asr-004633
03:50:43.160 --> 03:50:44.640
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and then it became Alex Ayala,

asr-004634
03:50:44.880 --> 03:50:47.080
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: then everybody's tuned in kung may Olympian tayo.

asr-004635
03:50:47.200 --> 03:50:48.540
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So ano ba naman itong 69 pesos

asr-004636
03:50:48.540 --> 03:50:49.960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: na pakainin yung athletes natin?

asr-004637
03:50:49.960 --> 03:50:50.720
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I just wanted to hear it.

asr-004638
03:50:50.720 --> 03:50:51.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Thank you.

asr-004639
03:50:51.660 --> 03:50:54.040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Thank you, Senator Pia.

asr-004640
03:50:54.080 --> 03:50:54.840
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Is that your last question?

asr-004641
03:50:54.860 --> 03:50:56.380
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So then my last point is,

asr-004642
03:50:56.420 --> 03:51:03.220
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: it was about the student athletes,

asr-004643
03:51:03.340 --> 03:51:04.680
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: but when I saw you about it,

asr-004644
03:51:04.960 --> 03:51:06.260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: not the student athletes,

asr-004645
03:51:06.340 --> 03:51:07.480
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: just the athletes in general.

asr-004646
03:51:08.500 --> 03:51:08.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yeah.

asr-004647
03:51:12.500 --> 03:51:14.700
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So I was in the Asian Games,

asr-004648
03:51:15.040 --> 03:51:15.600
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and I'm sure,

asr-004649
03:51:16.200 --> 03:51:18.220
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I'm only speaking from the person,

asr-004650
03:51:18.380 --> 03:51:19.940
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: the experience I know.

asr-004651
03:51:19.940 --> 03:51:21.640
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: One of the athletes,

asr-004652
03:51:21.740 --> 03:51:23.740
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: who joined the paddle tournament,

asr-004653
03:51:23.740 --> 03:51:25.300
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and one of my first supporters

asr-004654
03:51:25.300 --> 03:51:26.740
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: is no less than the secretary

asr-004655
03:51:26.740 --> 03:51:29.380
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: with the paddle court in Balear, Aurora.

asr-004656
03:51:30.760 --> 03:51:32.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: One of my, one of our athletes,

asr-004657
03:51:34.060 --> 03:51:35.560
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: he doesn't even play,

asr-004658
03:51:35.660 --> 03:51:38.160
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: but he supports the growth of the sport.

asr-004659
03:51:38.600 --> 03:51:39.620
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: His son plays very well.

asr-004660
03:51:39.620 --> 03:51:40.720
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: I played once, Madam Chair.

asr-004661
03:51:40.720 --> 03:51:41.420
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Okay, played once.

asr-004662
03:51:41.500 --> 03:51:41.840
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Plays on.

asr-004663
03:51:41.940 --> 03:51:42.380
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yeah.

asr-004664
03:51:42.700 --> 03:51:44.640
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So he will, I'm sure he will be good,

asr-004665
03:51:44.760 --> 03:51:45.920
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: but I haven't seen him play.

asr-004666
03:51:45.980 --> 03:51:49.140
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Anyway, so one of our athletes,

asr-004667
03:51:50.140 --> 03:51:51.080
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: our youngest athlete,

asr-004668
03:51:51.080 --> 03:51:51.640
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: just graduated,

asr-004669
03:51:51.660 --> 03:51:53.220
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Magna Cumlaude from UP.

asr-004670
03:51:54.020 --> 03:51:55.800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So she played in the Asian Games,

asr-004671
03:51:56.380 --> 03:51:57.780
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: but it's not that rare, no?

asr-004672
03:51:57.820 --> 03:51:58.600
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: You'll hear of this,

asr-004673
03:51:58.880 --> 03:52:00.780
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and our bronze medalist,

asr-004674
03:52:01.740 --> 03:52:03.680
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: what's her, Victoria Bosong?

asr-004675
03:52:03.960 --> 03:52:05.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Am I saying her name right?

asr-004676
03:52:05.560 --> 03:52:06.700
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: She got the bronze medal.

asr-004677
03:52:07.000 --> 03:52:07.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: She's also a,

asr-004678
03:52:08.240 --> 03:52:11.600
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: an honor student, no?

asr-004679
03:52:11.680 --> 03:52:13.680
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: In the US.

asr-004680
03:52:13.780 --> 03:52:15.180
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I'm not sure where she studies.

asr-004681
03:52:15.600 --> 03:52:17.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: It's not that uncommon.

asr-004682
03:52:17.600 --> 03:52:18.980
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: It's not that uncommon.

asr-004683
03:52:19.120 --> 03:52:19.740
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: The point is,

asr-004684
03:52:20.080 --> 03:52:21.360
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: the athletes have the discipline.

asr-004685
03:52:21.360 --> 03:52:21.600
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: If we talk about the athletes,

asr-004686
03:52:21.620 --> 03:52:22.800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: if we create that environment,

asr-004687
03:52:22.940 --> 03:52:24.140
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and I'm not just speaking of athletes,

asr-004688
03:52:24.260 --> 03:52:25.120
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: they could be musicians,

asr-004689
03:52:25.900 --> 03:52:26.980
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: they could be artists.

asr-004690
03:52:27.580 --> 03:52:29.420
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: If we give them that environment

asr-004691
03:52:29.420 --> 03:52:30.520
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: where they can thrive,

asr-004692
03:52:30.720 --> 03:52:31.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and these,

asr-004693
03:52:32.920 --> 03:52:33.140
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: you know,

asr-004694
03:52:33.180 --> 03:52:36.980
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: we can creatively accommodate them,

asr-004695
03:52:37.460 --> 03:52:39.480
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: then not only will we have great artists,

asr-004696
03:52:39.820 --> 03:52:40.500
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: great musicians,

asr-004697
03:52:41.040 --> 03:52:41.940
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: great athletes,

asr-004698
03:52:42.460 --> 03:52:45.780
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: they will also be able to finish with degrees

asr-004699
03:52:45.780 --> 03:52:48.420
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and maybe become doctors

asr-004700
03:52:48.420 --> 03:52:50.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and architects or whatever.

asr-004701
03:52:50.400 --> 03:52:51.500
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So that's my point.

asr-004702
03:52:51.600 --> 03:52:52.600
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And, you know,

asr-004703
03:52:52.600 --> 03:52:55.480
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I know it's so hard with such a big department,

asr-004704
03:52:55.780 --> 03:52:58.460
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: but I hope that you can still find the time

asr-004705
03:52:58.460 --> 03:52:59.820
