03:59:04.040 --> 03:59:06.100
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: textbook. So until delivery time,

asr-004896
03:59:06.200 --> 03:59:07.260
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: that would be years.

asr-004897
03:59:09.640 --> 03:59:09.960
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: So

asr-004898
03:59:09.960 --> 03:59:11.820
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: yun po, the procurement

asr-004899
03:59:11.820 --> 03:59:13.480
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: process had been shortened

asr-004900
03:59:13.480 --> 03:59:16.080
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: significantly. We would also

asr-004901
03:59:16.080 --> 03:59:18.180
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: like to express at this point

asr-004902
03:59:18.180 --> 03:59:20.060
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: that in the previous ten

asr-004903
03:59:20.060 --> 03:59:21.860
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: years, we were only able

asr-004904
03:59:21.860 --> 03:59:24.000
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: to procure 27 out of

asr-004905
03:59:24.000 --> 03:59:26.040
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: 88 titles. And then

asr-004906
03:59:26.040 --> 03:59:26.960
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: in school years,

