DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: 60 out of 105 titles.

asr-004909
03:59:31.900 --> 03:59:33.780
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: But for the first time, we really

asr-004910
03:59:33.780 --> 03:59:36.000
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: succeeded to procure all

asr-004911
03:59:36.000 --> 03:59:38.140
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: 105 titles

