03:59:44.040 --> 03:59:45.780
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: we were trying to create

asr-004916
03:59:45.780 --> 03:59:48.100
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: new textbooks every

asr-004917
03:59:48.100 --> 03:59:49.900
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: year. Well now, we just...

asr-004918
03:59:50.060 --> 03:59:52.040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Tama po ba? We chose

asr-004919
03:59:52.040 --> 03:59:54.220
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: the available in the market and we bought

asr-004920
03:59:54.220 --> 03:59:54.600
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: that?

asr-004920-split-2
03:59:54.600 --> 03:59:55.480
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: Yes po.

asr-004920-split-3
03:59:55.480 --> 03:59:55.720
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Okay.

asr-004921
03:59:55.940 --> 03:59:57.960
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Pre-accredited na ho yung...

asr-004922
03:59:57.960 --> 03:59:59.740
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: If you were accredited before, then you're part of that list.

asr-004923
04:00:00.000 --> 04:00:01.340
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: The regions can buy those books already.

asr-004924
04:00:01.340 --> 04:00:05.160
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And we were doing this every year, parang inuulit natin yung proseso before?

asr-004925
04:00:05.580 --> 04:00:08.900
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Hindi na po natin, unlike before where you had a new policy every year.

asr-004926
04:00:09.020 --> 04:00:10.000
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yeah, that's my...

asr-004927
04:00:10.000 --> 04:00:10.360
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Hindi na po ganun.

asr-004928
04:00:10.900 --> 04:00:11.280
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Okay.

asr-004929
04:00:11.360 --> 04:00:14.240
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Existing policy and then the list will expand na lang.

asr-004930
04:00:14.360 --> 04:00:18.100
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: If we've already accredited the 150 books, then you're accredited already.

asr-004931
04:00:18.360 --> 04:00:23.280
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Congratulations for a simple policy shift that yielded such great results.

asr-004932
04:00:23.280 --> 04:00:28.300
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Well, this EDCOM was a big help in pointing out these deficiencies, Your Honor.

asr-004933
04:00:28.300 --> 04:00:31.980
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: And then yung process of developing the manuscript would take one year.

asr-004934
04:00:32.240 --> 04:00:34.260
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: The process of printing would take another year.

asr-004935
04:00:34.520 --> 04:00:35.980
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Then the delivery would take another year.

asr-004936
04:00:36.260 --> 04:00:41.860
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: So rather than yung printing and delivery, that's already one contract pinagsama na ho namin.

asr-004937
04:00:42.040 --> 04:00:44.320
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: So whoever is going to print it, you deliver it also.

asr-004938
04:00:44.740 --> 04:00:46.220
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Hindi na sineparate yung contract.

asr-004939
04:00:46.600 --> 04:00:51.040
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: And then yung developing of the manuscript, it's no longer an exclusive dep-ed prerogative, Your Honor.

asr-004940
04:00:51.560 --> 04:00:53.240
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: It can be pre-accredited books.

asr-004941
04:00:53.300 --> 04:00:55.040
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: It can be the books bought by the private schools.

asr-004942
04:00:55.380 --> 04:00:58.040
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: The universe is open, basically, to whoever.

asr-004943
04:00:58.300 --> 04:01:01.300
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: However, books are of a sufficient quality, Your Honor.

asr-004944
04:01:02.880 --> 04:01:08.440
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Dati kasi manuscript, if I'm not mistaken, pinapabid ba yun?

asr-004945
04:01:09.200 --> 04:01:11.160
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yung procurement, pinapabid ba yun?

asr-004946
04:01:11.340 --> 04:01:15.520
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Three different, so three years ho ang whole process.

asr-004947
04:01:15.720 --> 04:01:21.940
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: So that really, early procurement, because we have a very good procurement specialist, Yusec Ruiz.

asr-004948
04:01:21.940 --> 04:01:24.700
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: She did early procurement for many of these.

asr-004949
04:01:24.820 --> 04:01:28.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: That's why nakompleto na ho namin yung 100.

asr-004950
04:01:28.300 --> 04:01:30.580
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So from start to end, normally, three years yan.

asr-004951
04:01:31.120 --> 04:01:36.060
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So ngayon, you just accredit the books, and then dep-ed buys from those accredited books.

asr-004952
04:01:36.500 --> 04:01:38.340
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ang LGU, pwede rin bumili sila doon eh.

asr-004953
04:01:38.380 --> 04:01:38.860
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Pwede rin ho.

asr-004954
04:01:39.020 --> 04:01:40.480
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: The regions are free to choose ho.

asr-004955
04:01:40.540 --> 04:01:41.040
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: They have a menu.

asr-004956
04:01:41.140 --> 04:01:42.600
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Parang menu na lang ho siya, Mr. President.

asr-004957
04:01:42.600 --> 04:01:44.900
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: The regions can also buy using their own funds, no?

asr-004958
04:01:44.900 --> 04:01:49.780
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So to augment the dep-ed central deliveries, no?

asr-004959
04:01:49.920 --> 04:01:52.880
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I know some LGUs, they buy to augment rin eh.

asr-004960
04:01:52.880 --> 04:01:57.180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kung hindi kulang, or hindi siya on time.

asr-004961
04:01:58.300 --> 04:02:00.300
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: LGU bumibili rin using their SEF.

asr-004962
04:02:00.400 --> 04:02:01.160
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: That's correct, Mr. President.

asr-004963
04:02:01.160 --> 04:02:09.500
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So right now, narinig ko kay Yusec, Mel, on the average, we're at around 70%.

asr-004964
04:02:09.500 --> 04:02:11.400
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Tama po ba, Yusec?

asr-004965
04:02:12.760 --> 04:02:13.400
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: Yes, po.

asr-004966
04:02:13.700 --> 04:02:19.340
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And this is using the 2026 funds or the funds prior?

asr-004967
04:02:19.920 --> 04:02:21.200
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: The funds.

asr-004967-split-2
04:02:21.200 --> 04:02:22.300
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Or both?

asr-004967-split-3
04:02:22.300 --> 04:02:23.120
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: Both po.

asr-004968
04:02:23.120 --> 04:02:24.040
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Okay. Alright.

asr-004969
04:02:24.240 --> 04:02:27.660
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Because ang next question ko is,

asr-004970
04:02:28.300 --> 04:02:33.260
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I saw in the budget that for 2027,

asr-004971
04:02:34.320 --> 04:02:40.540
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: the textbook funds went down to 6.4 billion pesos.

asr-004972
04:02:40.540 --> 04:02:43.280
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So how will this affect our aspiration?

asr-004973
04:02:43.500 --> 04:02:45.000
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Because malapit na tayo eh.

asr-004974
04:02:45.920 --> 04:02:48.020
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: We're at 70% on the average.

asr-004975
04:02:48.840 --> 04:02:52.040
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And konti na lang, we'll reach the 100% mark.

asr-004976
04:02:52.260 --> 04:02:52.620
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Sige po.

asr-004977
