DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: 105 titles this year,

asr-004979
04:03:01.120 --> 04:03:05.280
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: we don't need to procure new titles for the coming school year.

asr-004980
04:03:05.700 --> 04:03:09.820
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: Yung 6.4 po, kailangan natin yan for kindergarten,

asr-004981
