DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: because those are consumables,

asr-004982
04:03:12.260 --> 04:03:14.720
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: and then for the learners with disabilities,

asr-004983
04:03:15.440 --> 04:03:21.840
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: and then po for the replacement for lost and damaged books, basically po.

asr-004984
04:03:21.840 --> 04:03:26.560
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: And then we'll also use some of that for certain tech pro courses

asr-004985
04:03:26.560 --> 04:03:28.160
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: for the senior high school.

asr-004986
04:03:28.300 --> 04:03:34.520
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But we're still, these textbooks are still the ones students will have to leave in the school, di ba?

asr-004987
04:03:34.520 --> 04:03:36.920
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Hindi pa ito yung inuwi nila sa kanila pa.

asr-004988
04:03:36.920 --> 04:03:39.820
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: Pwede po nilang uwiin yung textbook.

asr-004989
04:03:39.820 --> 04:03:44.680
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: But because of the funds that you provided us last year,

asr-004990
04:03:44.680 --> 04:03:48.260
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: we've also been able to produce workbooks.

asr-004991
04:03:48.260 --> 04:03:51.860
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: Tinatapos po natin yung workbooks natin ngayon.

asr-004992
04:03:51.860 --> 04:03:57.740
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: In fact, we will be distributing the workbooks for the third term for Key Stage 1.

asr-004995
04:03:58.300 --> 04:04:01.320
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: And then for the coming school year po,

asr-004996
04:04:01.320 --> 04:04:06.800
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: we are hoping to produce workbooks for all the grade levels,

asr-004997
04:04:06.800 --> 04:04:08.580
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: already grades 1 to 10.

asr-004998
04:04:08.580 --> 04:04:10.200
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And the workbooks, they take home?

asr-004999
04:04:10.200 --> 04:04:13.300
