asr-005000
04:04:13.300 --> 04:04:17.440
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But that will now stop in 2027.

asr-005001
04:04:17.440 --> 04:04:20.120
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Because it's not funded anymore.

asr-005002
04:04:20.120 --> 04:04:21.000
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: Yes po.

asr-005003
04:04:21.000 --> 04:04:23.320
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Di ba? Kasi that's only funded for 2026.

asr-005004
04:04:23.320 --> 04:04:23.620
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: Yes po.

asr-005005
04:04:23.620 --> 04:04:26.860
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And workbooks kasi, parang consumable siya eh.

asr-005006
04:04:26.860 --> 04:04:28.180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: They cannot...

asr-005007
04:04:28.180 --> 04:04:29.840
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Return it to...

asr-005008
04:04:29.840 --> 04:04:31.580
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: The textbooks, they return it to school.

asr-005009
04:04:31.700 --> 04:04:32.200
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: Yes po.

asr-005010
04:04:32.440 --> 04:04:34.000
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Itong workbooks, hindi na nila.

asr-005011
04:04:34.180 --> 04:04:34.860
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Sayang naman.

asr-005012
04:04:37.100 --> 04:04:41.300
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Just give us an idea on how much the workbooks will cost.

asr-005013
04:04:41.700 --> 04:04:44.160
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Sa Valenzuela, we printed our own workbooks actually.

asr-005014
04:04:44.180 --> 04:04:44.580
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: Yes po.

asr-005015
04:04:44.780 --> 04:04:50.160
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, but hopefully, that can also be done nationwide.

asr-005016
04:04:50.160 --> 04:04:56.880
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kung hindi man nila sa kanila yung textbooks,

asr-005017
04:04:57.340 --> 04:04:58.160
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: at least yung workbooks,

asr-005018
04:04:58.180 --> 04:04:58.860
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: sa kanila yun.

asr-005019
04:04:59.620 --> 04:05:01.080
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I think some LGUs do dati.

asr-005020
04:05:02.080 --> 04:05:06.260
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, pasubmit nilang sa amin, Yusek Mel.

asr-005021
04:05:06.500 --> 04:05:06.900
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: Sige po.

asr-005022
04:05:06.960 --> 04:05:08.380
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: That would be most helpful.

asr-005023
04:05:08.860 --> 04:05:11.860
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: Our current estimate is 5.5B,

asr-005024
04:05:12.180 --> 04:05:15.420
DepEd Undersecretary Carmela C. Oracion: but we will compute carefully and let you know po.

asr-005025
04:05:17.980 --> 04:05:21.400
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Next is, my next question is on Aral.

asr-005026
04:05:21.680 --> 04:05:27.180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And I showed earlier a slide that's one of the inspirations

asr-005027
04:05:28.180 --> 04:05:35.480
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: this year, 2026, because of the good outcome from our students.

asr-005028
04:05:35.600 --> 04:05:36.960
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: In fact, my numbers were low.

asr-005029
04:05:37.060 --> 04:05:44.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: 1.3 million pulled out of the struggling portion.

asr-005030
04:05:45.360 --> 04:05:47.920
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But kanina nakita ko sa DepEd, it's more than that.

asr-005031
04:05:48.060 --> 04:05:49.560
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: It's about 3 million plus.

asr-005032
04:05:49.560 --> 04:05:54.340
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, it's delivering what it intends to deliver,

asr-005033
04:05:54.680 --> 04:05:58.160
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: which is to teach our children how to read,

asr-005034
04:05:58.180 --> 04:05:59.480
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: and how to count.

asr-005035
04:06:00.100 --> 04:06:04.580
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But this year, na-zero yung budget ng aral,

asr-005036
04:06:04.700 --> 04:06:05.540
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: which is shocking.

asr-005037
04:06:06.360 --> 04:06:07.620
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Dahil kung ano pa yung,

asr-005038
04:06:08.320 --> 04:06:10.920
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: sabi ko nga kay Chairman Bam,

asr-005039
04:06:11.040 --> 04:06:13.760
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: kung ano pa yung gumagana, yung pa yung nawala.

asr-005040
04:06:14.220 --> 04:06:22.680
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, I want to understand

asr-005041
04:06:22.680 --> 04:06:27.480
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: kung magkano pa ang kailangan natin

asr-005042
04:06:27.480 --> 04:06:28.240
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: for aral.

asr-005043
04:06:28.320 --> 04:06:30.300
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Last year, we, or this year,

asr-005044
04:06:30.380 --> 04:06:35.200
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: we allocated 8.9 billion pesos for aral.

asr-005045
04:06:35.300 --> 04:06:37.900
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And I think this is something that we should continue,

asr-005046
04:06:38.600 --> 04:06:41.140
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: considering that we're still not out of the woods

asr-005047
04:06:41.140 --> 04:06:44.120
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: in terms of struggling readers.

asr-005048
04:06:44.320 --> 04:06:48.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: On the average, we still have 30% struggling readers

asr-005049
04:06:48.420 --> 04:06:50.340
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: across the different grades.

asr-005050
04:06:51.140 --> 04:06:55.040
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, ang gusto kong malaman is how much do we need?

asr-005051
04:06:55.200 --> 04:06:57.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: In bare numbers.

asr-005052
04:06:57.480 --> 04:07:02.320
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: To continue the aral program.

asr-005053
04:07:03.000 --> 04:07:06.820
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: The request is 15.9 billion, actually, Mr. Chair.

asr-005054
04:07:06.940 --> 04:07:09.740
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: But we'll be happy if you give us the same amount this year,

asr-005055
04:07:09.780 --> 04:07:14.140
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: or any other additional amount would be welcome, of course, Mr. Chair.

asr-005056
04:07:14.360 --> 04:07:17.340
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ano ang bare minimum, Secretary?

asr-005057
04:07:19.520 --> 04:07:22.480
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Do you have a number to...

asr-005058
04:07:23.180 --> 04:07:25.960
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I think ito, kay Chairman Bam,

asr-005059
