Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Maraming interchanging forces that influences violence.

asr-006483
05:11:53.940 --> 05:12:05.940
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: So, when we started working with DepEd, we've explored different modalities in terms of educating learners and training teachers to build up their capacity on violence prevention.

asr-006484
05:12:06.460 --> 05:12:07.180
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Ah, next slide, please.

asr-006485
05:12:09.320 --> 05:12:13.820
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: So, yung isang breakthrough po, actually, happened in 2024.

asr-006486
05:12:14.520 --> 05:12:26.620
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Ito yung tinatawag natin na anti-OSAEC classroom-based sessions, wherein the challenge was how do you now, how do you do prevention and education sessions directly inside the classroom?

asr-006489
05:12:28.560 --> 05:12:33.600
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Ito po ay enabled ng implementing rules and regulation ng RA 11930.

asr-006490
05:12:33.820 --> 05:12:45.800
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: So, actually, may mandate si DepEd na dapat inside the classroom, nagtuturo ng mga gantong concepts tulad ng body boundaries, consent, recognizing risky and unsafe situations, and help-seeking behavior.

asr-006491
05:12:45.800 --> 05:12:53.800
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: The good thing is that noong in-implementation ng 2024, since 2024, at tuloy-tuloy, the DepEd, through the...

asr-006492
05:12:53.920 --> 05:12:59.840
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: The DepEd Learners' Rights and Protection Division has managed to reach 8.5 million learners.

asr-006493
05:13:00.540 --> 05:13:09.460
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: And sa isang outcome study, tatlo sa apat na learners, yung nagsabi na nag-increase yung self-protection knowledge nila and yung willingness to disclose.

asr-006494
05:13:10.340 --> 05:13:17.860
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: In fact, hindi ko sinama sa slide, doon sa last tranche of implementation, nagkaroon ng 4,000 disclosures after the session.

asr-006495
05:13:17.860 --> 05:13:23.860
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: So imagine that, 4,000 learners who

asr-006496
05:13:23.920 --> 05:13:28.900
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: have received the intervention as mandated by the DepEd protocols on helping learners.

asr-006497
05:13:29.540 --> 05:13:34.140
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: 4,000 na maaring hindi nag-disclose kung walang gantong targeted session.

asr-006498
05:13:34.600 --> 05:13:41.640
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: So, it is a very successful program, I would say, na ginawa ng DepEd Learner Rights and Protection Division.

asr-006499
05:13:42.140 --> 05:13:42.660
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Next slide po.

asr-006500
05:13:44.640 --> 05:13:48.040
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: So, yung issue natin na isa ay bullying.

asr-006501
05:13:49.160 --> 05:13:53.660
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: So, looking at the model of the anti-OSAEC classroom-based education,

asr-006502
05:13:53.920 --> 05:14:00.980
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Again, together with the Learner Rights and Protection Division, we've developed anti-bullying classroom-based sessions.

asr-006503
05:14:01.280 --> 05:14:07.480
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: So, ang kagandahan, it was developed in consultation with learners and personnel themselves.

asr-006504
05:14:08.260 --> 05:14:16.340
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: So, siya po ay kade-develop lang this year and hopefully it will be deployed in time for the National Children's Month of 2026.

asr-006505
05:14:16.760 --> 05:14:17.340
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Next slide po.

asr-006506
05:14:17.340 --> 05:14:27.040
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: So, min-mirror niya yung same strategy at yun nga, tulad ng nabang ito, very consultative yung development.

asr-006507
05:14:27.880 --> 05:14:28.460
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Next slide po.

asr-006508
05:14:31.040 --> 05:14:31.560
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Next.

asr-006509
05:14:33.940 --> 05:14:39.180
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Nag-de-develop din po kami with the Learner Rights and Protection Division ng isang companion app, learning app,

asr-006510
05:14:39.180 --> 05:14:47.240
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: na pwedeng i-leverage yung technology to teach bullying prevention knowledge to children.

asr-006511
05:14:47.340 --> 05:14:48.200
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Next po.

asr-006512
05:14:49.700 --> 05:14:53.620
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Tapos nakikita natin kanina yung power ng peer-to-peer approach.

asr-006513
05:14:54.340 --> 05:15:00.140
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: So, the way Stairway works with DepEd is that we take our local implementation experience, which...

asr-006514
05:15:00.000 --> 05:15:03.080
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: is evidence-based, and then scale it up with DepEd

asr-006515
05:15:03.080 --> 05:15:05.700
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: para mas makarating sa mas maraming learners.

asr-006516
05:15:05.860 --> 05:15:09.300
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Kasi if we are looking at these various child protection problems

asr-006517
05:15:09.300 --> 05:15:13.340
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: as a national problem, the solution should also be national in scope.

asr-006518
05:15:13.940 --> 05:15:15.760
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Marami kasing schools, yung piecemeal,

asr-006519
05:15:16.080 --> 05:15:17.820
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: nag-implement na sarili nilang intervention,

asr-006520
05:15:18.180 --> 05:15:22.620
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: pero marami naging schools yung merong gaps in capacity

asr-006521
05:15:22.620 --> 05:15:25.360
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: in terms of anong materials yung gagamitin ko.

asr-006522
05:15:25.640 --> 05:15:27.840
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: And this is where these interventions come in.

asr-006523
05:15:27.840 --> 05:15:32.060
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: So for example, this peer educators program na ginagawa namin,

asr-006524
05:15:32.240 --> 05:15:32.920
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: next slide po,

asr-006525
05:15:34.640 --> 05:15:37.740
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: it's being implemented in our home base in Puerto Galera

asr-006526
05:15:37.740 --> 05:15:41.300
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: and discusses these different topics wherein, next slide,

asr-006527
05:15:42.880 --> 05:15:45.220
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: ang nagde-deliver ay mga peer educators themselves.

asr-006528
05:15:45.660 --> 05:15:50.300
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: So nakita namin yung kapangyarihan na kapag yung message ay nanggagaling sa kapwa bata

asr-006529
05:15:50.300 --> 05:15:52.620
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: at naka-design safely yung materials,

asr-006530
05:15:53.280 --> 05:15:56.620
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: mas mataas yung learning retention in terms of these safety messages.

asr-006531
05:15:57.080 --> 05:15:57.820
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Next slide.

asr-006532
05:15:57.840 --> 05:16:00.460
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: And now last but not the least,

asr-006533
05:16:00.780 --> 05:16:05.360
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: yung isang magandang framing sa child protection program ng DEPED is,

asr-006534
05:16:05.880 --> 05:16:07.740
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: yun nga, yung nabanggit ng sekretary kanina,

asr-006535
05:16:08.280 --> 05:16:12.840
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: yung kaagapay program was originally for academic nature,

asr-006536
05:16:13.640 --> 05:16:17.720
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: pero dahil nga sa nangyaring spate of school violence,

asr-006537
05:16:18.200 --> 05:16:23.140
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: na-transform siya to be more of a, dun sa child protection yung framing.

asr-006538
05:16:23.480 --> 05:16:27.680
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: So ang ginawa po namin with DEPED is to develop what we call

asr-006539
05:16:27.680 --> 05:16:30.000
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: the Kaagapay Parenting in the Digital Age,

asr-006540
05:16:30.520 --> 05:16:36.020
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: kung saan nare-recognize natin na marami doon sa mga violence cases,

asr-006541
05:16:36.860 --> 05:16:39.660
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: na-disrupt sana natin kung nagkaroon ng early detection,

asr-006542
05:16:40.260 --> 05:16:44.220
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: kung si parent na-detect na niya, teka lang may pinagdadaan yung anak ko,

asr-006543
05:16:44.680 --> 05:16:51.520
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: and nag-access siya ng help sa school, for example, sa advisor, sa school guidance counselor,

asr-006544
05:16:51.520 --> 05:16:56.180
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: na may napapansin po ka sana ako, baka pwedeng pagtulungan natin.

asr-006545
05:16:56.960 --> 05:16:57.660
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: So what?

asr-006546
05:16:57.680 --> 05:17:01.480
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: So what we did was we developed a very simple session guide and session deck,

asr-006547
05:17:01.940 --> 05:17:07.100
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: tapos nagkaroon ngayon ng series of rollouts sa regional levels at magkakaroon ng cascading training.

asr-006548
05:17:07.660 --> 05:17:14.500
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: In fact, nagkaroon ng dalawang Kaagapay Parenting Roadshow sa Cainta Rizal and Santiago Isabela,

asr-006549
05:17:15.000 --> 05:17:16.800
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: at napakaganda ng feedback ng parents.

asr-006550
05:17:17.180 --> 05:17:18.840
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: So ano po yung tinuturo sa Kaagapay?

asr-006551
05:17:19.380 --> 05:17:23.080
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Number one, yung tinatawag namin na four C's of online risks.

asr-006552
05:17:23.800 --> 05:17:27.080
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Mahirap gabaya ng mga parents yung anak nila kung hindi nila naintindihan,

asr-006553
05:17:27.680 --> 05:17:31.660
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: ano yung mga iba't-ibang online risks na maaaring kaharapin ng mga anak nila.

asr-006554
05:17:32.340 --> 05:17:36.520
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Pangalawa, ano yung mga online parenting and reporting tools, ano yung options nila?

asr-006555
05:17:36.940 --> 05:17:40.860
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: At for us, yung pinaka-importante yung huli, yung parenting strategies.

asr-006556
05:17:41.480 --> 05:17:42.420
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Last slide, please.

asr-006557
05:17:44.060 --> 05:17:46.900
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: So ito po yung, kumusta, kasama ka, sundo ka, Kaagapay?

asr-006558
05:17:47.000 --> 05:17:47.820
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Ito po yung framing.

asr-006559
05:17:48.340 --> 05:17:50.920
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: So basically, ang tinuturo sa parents, next click po,

asr-006560
05:17:51.720 --> 05:17:57.660
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: sa kumusta, pinapaunawa sa mga parents na importante yung pangumusta sa araw-araw na buhay,

asr-006561
05:17:57.680 --> 05:18:04.560
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: na pag-uwi mo ng bahay, hindi mo lang kakamusta yung anak mo tungkol sa kamusta ang exam mo,

asr-006562
05:18:04.700 --> 05:18:10.920
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: kamusta yung test, et cetera, kundi may nagpasaya ba sa'yo ngayong araw, may nagpalungkot ba sa'yo?

asr-006563
05:18:11.420 --> 05:18:14.060
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: At yung paraan ng pagtatunong ay napaka-importante.

asr-006564
05:18:14.640 --> 05:18:15.740
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Pangalawa, yung kasama.

asr-006565
05:18:16.460 --> 05:18:18.660
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Kapag nagkapag-establish mo agad ng rapport,

asr-006566
05:18:19.360 --> 05:18:23.060
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: kailangan maintindihan ng parents yung ginagalawa na online ng mundo ng anak.

asr-006567
05:18:23.060 --> 05:18:25.960
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: So dito tinuturo sa parents, ano yung strategy na,

asr-006568
05:18:25.960 --> 05:18:30.120
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: paano mo maintindihan yung kinagigiliwa ng anak mo na online games?

asr-006569
05:18:30.640 --> 05:18:34.480
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: May isang parent during our session, nag-share siya at narinig na ibang parents.

asr-006570
05:18:35.100 --> 05:18:39.100
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Para maintindihan ko, nag-create ako ng Roblox account at kaming dalawa,

asr-006571
05:18:39.540 --> 05:18:41.360
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: naglalaro kami ng anak ko magkasama.

asr-006572
05:18:41.780 --> 05:18:43.120
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: So mas naintindihan ko ngayon.

asr-006573
05:18:44.240 --> 05:18:45.420
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Next po, yung kasundo.

asr-006574
05:18:46.760 --> 05:18:51.460
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Ito yung paglalatag ng online safety family agreements.

asr-006575
05:18:52.100 --> 05:18:55.940
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Importante sa mga pamilya na mayroong hangganan and boundaries.

asr-006576
05:18:55.960 --> 05:18:59.520
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: In terms of digital usage, digital lives ng mga bata.

asr-006577
05:18:59.960 --> 05:19:01.200
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Ito yung structure na kailangan.

asr-006578
05:19:01.340 --> 05:19:05.960
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Halimbawa, pag sa hapagkainan, wala muna tayong gadget use.

asr-006579
05:19:06.640 --> 05:19:10.520
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Kaya lang, sinasabi rin namin sa mga parents, kung mag-i-employ tayo ng ganitong agreement,

asr-006580
05:19:11.120 --> 05:19:16.240
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: dapat kayo rin bilang parent, huwag kayong gagamit ng cellphone habang nasa hapagkainan.

asr-006581
05:19:17.160 --> 05:19:19.760
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: And last but not the least is yung kaagapay concept.

asr-006582
05:19:20.320 --> 05:19:25.200
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Na kung saan tinuturo namin sa mga parents na kapag may nag-disclose na anak,

asr-006583
05:19:25.200 --> 05:19:28.980
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: dapat ganito yung paraan ng paghahandol ng disclosure.

asr-006584
05:19:29.520 --> 05:19:30.560
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Walang victim blaming.

asr-006585
05:19:31.820 --> 05:19:32.600
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Makikinig ka.

asr-006586
05:19:33.020 --> 05:19:37.420
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: At very importantly, i-access mo yung support system sa paaralan.

asr-006587
05:19:37.880 --> 05:19:42.400
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: So dito po yung framing noong kaagapay, parenting in the digital age.

asr-006588
05:19:42.580 --> 05:19:50.040
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: So kung titignan nyo, ang concept ay parenting in the digital age, hindi digital parenting.

asr-006589
05:19:50.740 --> 05:19:54.720
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Kasi never mas magiging expert ang magulang sa anak sa technology.

asr-006590
05:19:55.200 --> 05:20:00.340
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Pero may mga parenting skills na kahit hindi teki yung magulang,

asr-006591
05:20:00.560 --> 05:20:05.340
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: pag in-apply niya sa anak niya, mas magagabayin yung anak niya sa online world.

asr-006592
05:20:05.660 --> 05:20:06.480
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: So yun po yun, Jis.

asr-006593
05:20:06.600 --> 05:20:12.640
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Pero ito po yung pinaka ilan sa intervention and partnerships na pinwede aside from others.

asr-006594
05:20:12.780 --> 05:20:14.540
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Thank you, Mr. Deloy.

asr-006595
05:20:15.620 --> 05:20:20.720
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: With the indulgence of Senator Joel, sorry I was expecting a short presentation.

asr-006596
05:20:20.920 --> 05:20:21.940
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But this is very helpful.

asr-006597
05:20:22.960 --> 05:20:24.940
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Maraming maraming salamat po sa inyong...

asr-006598
05:20:25.200 --> 05:20:28.780
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: yung naibahagi, yung mga skwilahan natin dapat talaga ligtas.

asr-006599
05:20:29.460 --> 05:20:36.900
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And gaya na nasabi ko kanina, merong kailangan na pagpondo sa kagamitan.

asr-006600
05:20:37.420 --> 05:20:39.440
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And this is something we will work on.

asr-006601
05:20:39.960 --> 05:20:49.480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Pero sa kaduluduluan ng lahat, ang laki ng responsibilidad at ng roles ng mga teacher, magulang at mga bata.

asr-006602
05:20:50.420 --> 05:20:54.480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Nung nakwento mo na after the OSAEC module,

asr-006603
05:20:55.200 --> 05:20:59.280
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: merong 4,000 na bata ang nagsabi na they were at risk.

asr-006604
05:20:59.880 --> 05:21:06.320
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I'm hoping that habang niloroll out ninyo yung modules pagating sa karahasan,

asr-006605
05:21:07.080 --> 05:21:14.220
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: ay marami rin mga bata ang magsasabi na kailangan nila ng tulong para hindi sila tumuloy sa karahasan.

asr-006606
05:21:14.960 --> 05:21:19.200
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: If you look at the School Safety Act, malaking focus po doon yung mandatory...

asr-006607
05:21:19.900 --> 05:21:21.940
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: We call it a mandatory seminar for parents.

asr-006608
05:21:21.940 --> 05:21:23.360
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Pero parang ganito na rin yun.

asr-006609
05:21:24.080 --> 05:21:24.940
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Na kailangan talaga...

asr-006610
05:21:25.200 --> 05:21:34.640
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mas maalam yung mga magulang pagating sa ano yung nararanasan, ano yung kinalalagyan ng kanilang mga anak sa mundo ng online.

asr-006611
05:21:34.820 --> 05:21:43.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I mean, after the Tacloban shooting, nung umuwi ako, so pumunta ako, nakiramay, nagtanong-tanong, pag uwi ko,

asr-006612
05:21:44.340 --> 05:21:46.500
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: the first thing I did, ginek ko yung iPad ng anak ko.

asr-006613
05:21:46.500 --> 05:21:52.500
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kung yung parental controls, yung accounts, anong accounts yung...

asr-006614
05:21:52.500 --> 05:22:00.800
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yung naka-login siya, yung ibang accounts niya, accounts ko, so I had to check my accounts also on what platform she's on.

asr-006615
05:22:01.480 --> 05:22:09.320
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And honestly, yung mga nangyayaring karahasan, nakakatakot siya sa mga bata at sa mga guro,

asr-006616
05:22:09.480 --> 05:22:14.560
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: pero doble siguro yung takot ng mga magulang, honestly, sa nakikita natin.

asr-006617
05:22:14.560 --> 05:22:20.520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, we're hoping that DepEd can really start this even before the law is passed.

asr-006618
05:22:20.520 --> 05:22:24.260
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But tama po yung isang nabanggit niyo, Mr. Dilo, yung scale.

asr-006619
05:22:24.780 --> 05:22:31.320
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kasi maraming NGO, maraming grupong gustong tumulong, but only the DepEd infrastructure can really create the scale.

asr-006620
05:22:31.860 --> 05:22:33.420
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, this is a big challenge.

asr-006621
05:22:33.540 --> 05:22:40.340
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: 23 million learners, kung yung magulang times two, that's 50 million people that we have to reach out to,

asr-006622
05:22:40.380 --> 05:22:45.540
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: para malaman nila yung mga tamang patakaran pagating dito.

asr-006623
05:22:45.540 --> 05:22:48.540
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And again, I think we should be...

asr-006624
05:22:50.520 --> 05:23:11.480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: If somebody exhibits upstanding behavior, either magsumbong or magsabi, magkwento, kung sila man yan, o kaibigan nila, o kapatid nila,

asr-006625
05:23:11.980 --> 05:23:20.480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: that should be seen as a positive that we're able to create that culture where our students, the teachers, and the parents can safely talk about these problems,

asr-006626
05:23:20.520 --> 05:23:23.240
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: and bring it up to the proper authorities.

asr-006627
05:23:23.460 --> 05:23:25.100
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, maraming salamat, Mr. Dilo.

asr-006628
05:23:25.140 --> 05:23:27.360
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yes, last point po, before I go back to Senator Joel.

asr-006629
05:23:27.660 --> 05:23:28.580
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Salamat po, last point.

asr-006630
05:23:28.940 --> 05:23:31.500
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: This is my first time to sit in a budget deliberation.

asr-006631
05:23:31.640 --> 05:23:41.620
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: Napansin ko lang, bilang outsider, naslash yung child protection budget line ng DepEd from the original 80 million, naging 40 million lang right now.

asr-006632
05:23:41.620 --> 05:23:48.840
Stairway Foundation Child Protection Specialist Ysrael C. Diloy: I'm just confused bakit bumaba ng gano'n, where in fact, child protection is one crucial issue we're facing right now.

asr-006633
05:23:48.900 --> 05:23:49.240
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Exactly.

asr-006634
05:23:50.520 --> 05:23:53.320
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Confusion lang ba ang salita, Senator Joel?

asr-006635
05:23:53.380 --> 05:23:54.660
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Hindi lang confusion eh, kasi...

asr-006636
05:23:54.660 --> 05:23:58.020
Senator Joel Villanueva: May dami na akong kasalanang nasabi dito, nandito na doon yung tatay ko, ayoko lang magsalita.

asr-006637
05:23:58.560 --> 05:23:59.480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Is Brother Eddie here?

asr-006638
05:24:00.660 --> 05:24:01.360
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Sa likod?

asr-006639
05:24:01.860 --> 05:24:04.540
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: We'd like to acknowledge Brother Eddie Villanueva who is here.

asr-006640
05:24:05.740 --> 05:24:06.100
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Okay.

asr-006641
05:24:06.960 --> 05:24:07.640
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Thank you, sir.

asr-006642
05:24:07.780 --> 05:24:09.660
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But that's exactly what we're looking at, no?

asr-006643
05:24:09.660 --> 05:24:15.620
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Baka naman po ay kung wala man siya dun sa item na yun, baka napailalim siya sa ibang mga items, no?

asr-006644
05:24:16.020 --> 05:24:17.860
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, Senator Joel, maybe a final...

asr-006645
05:24:17.860 --> 05:24:20.460
Senator Joel Villanueva: Mr. Chairman, I'm no longer gonna ask.

asr-006646
05:24:20.520 --> 05:24:26.680
Senator Joel Villanueva: Anything, in fact, I can raise this through text message, Mr. Chairman.

asr-006647
05:24:26.680 --> 05:24:33.520
Senator Joel Villanueva: I just wanted to again congratulate the DepEd family headed by our brother, basketball teammate.

asr-006648
05:24:33.940 --> 05:24:41.860
Senator Joel Villanueva: I'd rather play basketball with him than ask him questions regarding the education situation of our country.

asr-006649
05:24:41.960 --> 05:24:43.880
Senator Joel Villanueva: Maraming salamat, Mr. Chairman. Thank you, Secretary.

asr-006650
05:24:44.000 --> 05:24:47.660
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ito ko nga, Senator Joel, maraming assist, walang block, di ba? Puro assist.

asr-006651
05:24:48.760 --> 05:24:50.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Puro lay-up. Puro lay-up.

asr-006652
05:24:50.520 --> 05:24:57.240
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, we'd like to thank the DepEd family, Secretary Angara, and everyone for spending the last five hours with us.

asr-006653
05:24:57.360 --> 05:24:58.360
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Maraming maraming salamat.

asr-006654
05:24:59.120 --> 05:25:01.000
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I hope to defend your budget well.

asr-006655
05:25:01.120 --> 05:25:05.340
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I hope by the time we're talking about your budget, we can see the increases, no?

asr-006656
05:25:05.380 --> 05:25:07.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: In the very important parts that we've seen.

asr-006657
05:25:07.140 --> 05:25:09.460
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, maraming salamat po and see you at the plenary. Thank you.

asr-006658
