Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ah, sorry. Ano yung line?

asr-006659
05:25:12.420 --> 05:25:20.140
Senator Joel Villanueva: I move, Mr. Chairman, that we approve on this level the budget of...

asr-006660
05:25:20.520 --> 05:25:25.420
Senator Joel Villanueva: the Department of Education and its attached agencies for plenary action, Mr. Chairman.

asr-006661
05:25:25.420 --> 05:25:26.580
Senator Joel Villanueva: And deemed submitted.

asr-006662
05:25:27.380 --> 05:25:28.280
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And it be deemed submitted.

asr-006663
05:25:28.280 --> 05:25:32.000
